formatarTamanho(att.byteSize) }}</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Modo Edição / Criação com Formulário Completo -->\n      <form class=\"form-container\" *ngIf=\"!isReadOnly\" (submit)=\"salvar(); $event.preventDefault()\">\n\n        <!-- GRUPO 1: Conteúdo da Nota -->\n        <div class=\"form-card\">\n          <div class=\"card-header\">\n            <mat-icon class=\"section-icon color-amber\">sticky_note_2</mat-icon>\n            <h3>Conteúdo & Informações</h3>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"form-grid\">\n            <div class=\"form-field col-span-2\">\n              <label>Título / Assunto <span class=\"required\">*</span></label>\n              <input\n                type=\"text\"\n                [(ngModel)]=\"title\"\n                name=\"title\"\n                placeholder=\"Ex: Reunião Geral de Alinhamento\"\n                required\n                autofocus\n              />\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"form-field col-span-2\">\n              <div class=\"field-label-row\">\n                <label>Descrição / Texto da Nota</label>\n                <app-ai-text-button [(text)]=\"content\" placeholderContext=\"conteúdo do aviso\"></app-ai-text-button>\n              </div>\n              <app-markdown-editor [text]=\"content\" (textChange)=\"content = $event\" placeholder=\"Escreva a nota, use formatação Markdown ou listas de tarefas (- [ ] item)...\"></app-markdown-editor>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- GRUPO 2: Organização & Estilo Visual -->\n        <div class=\"form-card\">\n          <div class=\"card-header\">\n            <mat-icon class=\"section-icon color-blue\">palette</mat-icon>\n            <h3>Organização & Visual do Cartão</h3>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"form-grid\">\n            <!-- Grupo / Seção -->\n            <div class=\"form-field\">\n              <label>Grupo / Seção no Mural</label>\n              <select [(ngModel)]=\"selectedGroupId\" name=\"selectedGroupId\" class=\"custom-select\">\n                <option [ngValue]=\"null\">📌 Sem Grupo (Nota Solta no Mural)</option>\n                <option *ngFor=\"let g of groups\" [ngValue]=\"g.id\">{{ g.title }}</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Fixar no Topo -->\n            <div class=\"form-field\">\n              <label>Destaque / Fixação</label>\n              <div class=\"pin-toggle-box\" (click)=\"isPinned = !isPinned\">\n                <mat-icon class=\"pin-icon\" [class.active]=\"isPinned\">push_pin</mat-icon>\n                <span>{{ isPinned ? 'Fixado em Destaque' : 'Fixação Normal' }}</span>\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" [(ngModel)]=\"isPinned\" name=\"isPinned\" class=\"hidden-checkbox\" />\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Seletor de Cores -->\n            <div class=\"form-field col-span-2\">\n              <label>Cor do Cartão</label>\n              <div class=\"color-palette-grid\">\n                <button\n                  type=\"button\"\n                  *ngFor=\"let opt of colorOptions\"\n                  class=\"color-circle\"\n                  [class.active]=\"selectedColor === opt.value\"\n                  [style.background]=\"opt.value\"\n                  [style.border-color]=\"opt.border\"\n                  [matTooltip]=\"opt.name\"\n                  (click)=\"selectedColor = opt.value\"\n                >\n                  <mat-icon *ngIf=\"selectedColor === opt.value\" class=\"check-icon\" [style.color]=\"opt.value === '#334155' ? '#ffffff' : '#0f172a'\">check</mat-icon>\n                </button>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- GRUPO 3: Anexos & Arquivos (Qualquer tipo de arquivo) -->\n        <div class=\"form-card\">\n          <div class=\"card-header\">\n            <mat-icon class=\"section-icon color-emerald\">attach_file</mat-icon>\n            <h3>Documentos, Códigos & Anexos</h3>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"attachments-section\">\n            <div class=\"upload-dropzone\">\n              <input\n                type=\"file\"\n                #fileInput\n                (change)=\"onFilesSelected($event)\"\n                multiple\n                style=\"display: none;\"\n              />\n              <button\n                type=\"button\"\n                class=\"btn-upload\"\n                (click)=\"fileInput.click()\"\n                [disabled]=\"loadingUpload\"\n              >\n                <mat-progress-spinner\n                  *ngIf=\"loadingUpload\"\n                  mode=\"indeterminate\"\n                  diameter=\"18\"\n                  class=\"button-spinner\"\n                ></mat-progress-spinner>\n                <mat-icon *ngIf=\"!loadingUpload\">cloud_upload</mat-icon>\n                <span>{{ loadingUpload ? 'Enviando anexos...' : 'Anexar Arquivos (Qualquer formato)' }}</span>\n              </button>\n              <span class=\"upload-hint\">Aceita códigos de programação, PDFs, imagens, documentos e planilhas</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Arquivos Pendentes (Mini-Cards sem botões visíveis, opções no botão direito) -->\n            <div class=\"pending-section-wrap\" *ngIf=\"pendingFiles.length > 0\">\n              <div class=\"pending-title\">Prontos para envio ao salvar (clique para pré-visualizar ou botão direito para opções):</div>\n              <div class=\"pending-attachments-list\">\n                <div\n                  class=\"attachment-item pending\"\n                  *ngFor=\"let file of pendingFiles; let i = index\"\n                  (click)=\"abrirPendingPreview(file)\"\n                  (contextmenu)=\"onPendingContextMenu($event, i)\"\n                  matTooltip=\"Clique para visualizar ou botão direito para opções\"\n                  [matTooltipShowDelay]=\"600\"\n                >\n                  <div class=\"attachment-info\">\n                    <mat-icon class=\"att-type-icon\" [style.color]=\"getFileInfo(file.name, file.type).color\">\n                      {{ getFileInfo(file.name, file.type).icon }}\n                    </mat-icon>\n                    <div class=\"att-text\">\n                      <span class=\"att-name\" [title]=\"file.name\">{{ file.name }}</span>\n                      <span class=\"att-size\">{{ formatarTamanho(file.size) }}</span>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Lista de Anexos Já Salvos (Mini-Cards sem botões visíveis, opções no botão direito) -->\n            <div class=\"attachments-list\" *ngIf=\"attachments.length > 0\">\n              <div\n                class=\"attachment-item\"\n                *ngFor=\"let att of attachments\"\n                (click)=\"abrirPreview(att)\"\n                (contextmenu)=\"onAttachmentContextMenu($event, att)\"\n                matTooltip=\"Clique para visualizar ou botão direito para opções\"\n                [matTooltipShowDelay]=\"600\"\n              >\n                <div class=\"attachment-info\">\n                  <mat-icon class=\"att-type-icon\" [style.color]=\"getFileInfo(att.fileName, att.mimeType).color\">\n                    {{ getFileInfo(att.fileName, att.mimeType).icon }}\n                  </mat-icon>\n                  <div class=\"att-text\">\n                    <span class=\"att-name\" [title]=\"att.fileName\">{{ att.fileName }}</span>\n                    <span class=\"att-size\">{{ formatarTamanho(att.byteSize) }}</span>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </form>\n\n      <!-- Trigger invisível para Menu de Contexto (Angular Material) -->\n      <div\n        class=\"context-menu-trigger-anchor\"\n        [style.left.px]=\"contextMenuPosition.x\"\n        [style.top.px]=\"contextMenuPosition.y\"\n        [matMenuTriggerFor]=\"attachmentContextMenu\"\n      ></div>\n\n      <!-- Menu de Contexto Angular Material -->\n      <mat-menu #attachmentContextMenu=\"matMenu\" class=\"mural-attachment-context-menu\">\n        <ng-template matMenuContent>\n          <!-- Opções para Anexo Salvo -->\n          <ng-container *ngIf=\"contextAttachment as att\">\n            <button mat-menu-item (click)=\"abrirPreview(att)\">\n              <mat-icon class=\"color-blue\">visibility</mat-icon>\n              <span>Visualizar anexo</span>\n            </button>\n            <button mat-menu-item (click)=\"baixarAnexo(att)\">\n              <mat-icon class=\"color-indigo\">download</mat-icon>\n              <span>Baixar arquivo</span>\n            </button>\n            <mat-divider *ngIf=\"!isReadOnly\"></mat-divider>\n            <button *ngIf=\"!isReadOnly\" mat-menu-item (click)=\"removerAnexo(att)\" class=\"menu-item-danger\">\n              <mat-icon class=\"color-red\">delete_outline</mat-icon>\n              <span>Excluir anexo</span>\n            </button>\n          </ng-container>\n\n          <!-- Opções para Arquivo Pendente -->\n          <ng-container *ngIf=\"contextPendingIndex !== null\">\n            <button mat-menu-item (click)=\"removerPendingFile(contextPendingIndex)\" class=\"menu-item-danger\">\n              <mat-icon class=\"color-red\">delete_outline</mat-icon>\n              <span>Remover da lista</span>\n            </button>\n          </ng-container>\n        </ng-template>\n      </mat-menu>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Fixed Footer -->\n    <div class=\"modal-footer\">\n      <ng-container *ngIf=\"isReadOnly\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-cancel\" (click)=\"enableEditMode()\">\n          <mat-icon>edit</mat-icon>\n          <span>Editar Cartão</span>\n        </button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-save\" (click)=\"fechar()\">\n          <mat-icon>close</mat-icon>\n          <span>Fechar</span>\n        </button>\n      </ng-container>\n\n      <ng-container *ngIf=\"!isReadOnly\">\n        <ng-container *ngIf=\"isEdit\">\n          <button *ngIf=\"!confirmDelete()\" type=\"button\" class=\"btn-delete\" (click)=\"excluir()\" [disabled]=\"loadingExcluir\">\n            <mat-icon>delete</mat-icon>\n            <span>Excluir</span>\n          </button>\n\n          <!-- Confirmação in-app integrada -->\n          <div class=\"delete-confirm-box\" *ngIf=\"confirmDelete()\">\n            <span class=\"confirm-text\">Confirmar exclusão?</span>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-delete confirm\" (click)=\"excluir()\" [disabled]=\"loadingExcluir\">\n              <mat-progress-spinner *ngIf=\"loadingExcluir\" mode=\"indeterminate\" diameter=\"16\" class=\"button-spinner\"></mat-progress-spinner>\n              <mat-icon *ngIf=\"!loadingExcluir\">check</mat-icon>\n              <span>Sim, excluir</span>\n            </button>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-cancel compact\" (click)=\"cancelarExclusao()\">Não</button>\n          </div>\n        </ng-container>\n\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-cancel\" (click)=\"fechar()\">Cancelar</button>\n\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-save\" (click)=\"salvar()\" [disabled]=\"loadingSalvar || !title.trim()\">\n          <mat-progress-spinner\n            *ngIf=\"loadingSalvar\"\n            mode=\"indeterminate\"\n            diameter=\"20\"\n            class=\"button-spinner\"\n          ></mat-progress-spinner>\n          <mat-icon *ngIf=\"!loadingSalvar\">save</mat-icon>\n          <span>{{ loadingSalvar ? 'Salvando...' : (isEdit ? 'Salvar Alterações' : 'Adicionar ao Mural') }}</span>\n        </button>\n      </ng-container>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Modal de Pré-visualização de Anexo -->\n<app-attachment-preview-modal\n  *ngIf=\"previewAttachmentUrl()\"\n  [fileName]=\"previewAttachmentName()\"\n  [fileUrl]=\"previewAttachmentUrl()\"\n  [mimeType]=\"previewAttachmentMimeType()\"\n  [rawContent]=\"previewAttachmentRawContent()\"\n  [byteSize]=\"previewAttachmentByteSize()\"\n  (close)=\"fecharPreview()\"\n  (download)=\"baixarAnexo()\"\n></app-attachment-preview-modal>\n","import { Component, OnInit, OnDestroy, inject, signal, computed, effect } from '@angular/core';\nimport { CommonModule } from '@angular/common';\nimport { FormsModule } from '@angular/forms';\nimport { ActivatedRoute, Router } from '@angular/router';\nimport { CdkDragDrop, DragDropModule, moveItemInArray } from '@angular/cdk/drag-drop';\nimport { MatIconModule } from '@angular/material/icon';\nimport { MatTooltipModule } from '@angular/material/tooltip';\nimport { MatProgressSpinnerModule } from '@angular/material/progress-spinner';\nimport { MatMenuModule } from '@angular/material/menu';\nimport { DomSanitizer, SafeResourceUrl } from '@angular/platform-browser';\nimport { finalize } from 'rxjs';\n\nimport { MuralBoard, MuralBoardSummary, MuralGroup, MuralItem } from '../../../core/models/mural.model';\nimport { Attachment } from '../../../core/models/attachment.model';\nimport { KanbanTeam, KanbanTeamMember } from '../../../core/models/kanban.model';\nimport { DEFAULT_AVATAR } from '../../../core/models/user.model';\nimport { AuthService } from '../../../core/services/auth.service';\nimport { MuralService } from '../../../core/services/mural.service';\nimport { KanbanService } from '../../../core/services/kanban.service';\nimport { AttachmentsService } from '../../../core/services/attachments.service';\nimport { SyncService } from '../../../core/services/sync.service';\nimport { MuralBoardApiService } from './mural-board.service';\nimport { MuralItemModalComponent } from '../mural-item-modal/mural-item-modal.component';\nimport { MarkdownTextComponent } from '../../../shared/components/markdown-text/markdown-text.component';\nimport { AiTextButtonComponent } from '../../../shared/components/ai-text-button/ai-text-button.component';\nimport { MarkdownEditorComponent } from '../../../shared/components/markdown-editor/markdown-editor.component';\nimport { AttachmentPreviewModalComponent } from '../../../shared/components/attachment-preview-modal/attachment-preview-modal.component';\nimport { detectFileType } from '../../../core/utils/code-highlight.util';\n\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-mural-board',\n  standalone: true,\n  imports: [\n    CommonModule,\n    FormsModule,\n    DragDropModule,\n    MatIconModule,\n    MatTooltipModule,\n    MatProgressSpinnerModule,\n    MatMenuModule,\n    MuralItemModalComponent,\n    MarkdownTextComponent,\n    AiTextButtonComponent,\n    MarkdownEditorComponent,\n    AttachmentPreviewModalComponent,\n  ],\n  templateUrl: './mural-board.component.html',\n  styleUrl: './mural-board.component.scss',\n})\nexport class MuralBoardComponent implements OnInit, OnDestroy {\n  readonly muralService = inject(MuralService);\n  readonly kanbanService = inject(KanbanService);\n  readonly auth = inject(AuthService);\n  private apiService = inject(MuralBoardApiService);\n  private attachmentsService = inject(AttachmentsService);\n  private syncService = inject(SyncService);\n  private router = inject(Router);\n  private route = inject(ActivatedRoute);\n  private sanitizer = inject(DomSanitizer);\n\n  readonly defaultAvatar = DEFAULT_AVATAR;\n  readonly boards = this.muralService.boards;\n  readonly activeBoard = this.muralService.activeBoard;\n  readonly loading = this.muralService.loading;\n  readonly teams = this.kanbanService.teams;\n\n  readonly hasPersonalBoards = computed(() => this.boards().some(b => b.scopeType === 'personal'));\n  readonly hasTeamBoards = computed(() => this.boards().some(b => b.scopeType === 'team'));\n\n  readonly search = signal('');\n  readonly groupFilter = signal<string | 'all'>('all');\n  readonly filterPinnedOnly = signal(false);\n  readonly filterWithAttachments = signal(false);\n\n  readonly colorPresets = [\n    { label: 'Âmbar', value: '#f59e0b' },\n    { label: 'Azul', value: '#0ea5e9' },\n    { label: 'Índigo', value: '#4f46e5' },\n    { label: 'Esmeralda', value: '#10b981' },\n    { label: 'Rosa', value: '#ec4899' },\n    { label: 'Vermelho', value: '#ef4444' },\n    { label: 'Roxo', value: '#8b5cf6' },\n    { label: 'Cinza', value: '#64748b' },\n    { label: 'Turquesa', value: '#06b6d4' },\n  ];\n\n  // Modals state\n  readonly itemModalOpen = signal(false);\n  readonly itemModalReadOnly = signal(false);\n  readonly editingItem = signal<MuralItem | null>(null);\n  readonly targetGroupId = signal<string | null>(null);\n  readonly muralItemContextMenu = signal<{ item: MuralItem; x: number; y: number } | null>(null);\n\n  readonly groupModalOpen = signal(false);\n  readonly editingGroup = signal<MuralGroup | null>(null);\n  groupTitle = '';\n  groupColor = '#64748b';\n\n  readonly boardModalOpen = signal(false);\n  boardName = '';\n  boardDescription = '';\n  boardColor = '#f59e0b';\n\n  // Novo Mural modal state\n  readonly createBoardModalOpen = signal(false);\n  newBoardName = '';\n  newBoardDescription = '';\n  newBoardColor = '#f59e0b';\n  newBoardScopeType: 'personal' | 'team' = 'personal';\n  newBoardTeamId: string | null = null;\n  loadingCriarMural = false;\n\n  // HTTP loading variables\n  loadingSalvarGrupo = false;\n  loadingExcluirGrupo = false;\n  loadingSalvarMural = false;\n  loadingExcluirMural = false;\n\n  // Drag & Drop state\n  draggingItemId: string | null = null;\n  private draggingItem: MuralItem | null = null;\n  dragOverGroupId: string | null = null;\n\n  // Team modal state (Exato ao Tarefas)\n  readonly teamModalOpen = signal(false);\n  readonly creatingTeam = signal(false);\n  newTeamName = '';\n  newTeamDescription = '';\n  newTeamColor = '#4f46e5';\n  invitedUserId = '';\n\n  readonly inviteableUsers = computed(() => [...this.auth.allUsers()].sort((first, second) =>\n    (first.name || first.email || '').localeCompare(second.name || second.email || '', 'pt-BR', { sensitivity: 'base' })\n  ));\n\n  // In-app confirmations & alert states\n  readonly confirmDeleteGroup = signal(false);\n  readonly confirmDeleteBoard = signal(false);\n  readonly confirmDeleteTeam = signal(false);\n  readonly errorMessage = signal<string | null>(null);\n\n  private initializedUserId = '';\n  private readonly workspaceInitialization = effect(() => {\n    const user = this.auth.currentUser();\n    if (!user?.id || user.id === this.initializedUserId) return;\n    this.initializedUserId = user.id;\n    const requestedId = this.route.snapshot.paramMap.get('boardId');\n    this.muralService.loadBoards(requestedId || undefined);\n    this.kanbanService.loadTeams();\n  });\n\n  private readonly activeBoardUrlSynchronization = effect(() => {\n    const active = this.activeBoard();\n    if (!active?.id) return;\n    const currentPath = this.router.url.split('?')[0];\n    if (currentPath.startsWith('/mural')) {\n      const expectedUrl = `/mural/${active.id}`;\n      if (currentPath !== expectedUrl) {\n        void this.router.navigate(['/mural', active.id], { replaceUrl: currentPath === '/mural' });\n      }\n    }\n  });\n\n  readonly currentTeam = computed(() => {\n    const active = this.activeBoard();\n    if (!active?.teamId) return this.teams()[0] || null;\n    return this.teams().find(t => t.id === active.teamId) || null;\n  });\n\n  // Attachment preview in board\n  previewAttachmentUrl = signal<string | null>(null);\n  previewAttachmentName = signal('');\n  previewAttachmentMimeType = signal('');\n  previewAttachmentRawContent = signal<string | null>(null);\n  previewAttachmentByteSize = signal<number | undefined>(undefined);\n  previewCurrentAttachment = signal<Attachment | null>(null);\n\n  private unsubscribeRealtime?: () => void;\n\n  get currentUserId(): string {\n    return this.auth.currentUser()?.id || 'anonymous';\n  }\n\n  // Filtered Items computed\n  readonly filteredItems = computed(() => {\n    const board = this.activeBoard();\n    if (!board) return [];\n\n    const query = this.search().trim().toLowerCase();\n    const gFilter = this.groupFilter();\n    const pinnedOnly = this.filterPinnedOnly();\n    const withAtts = this.filterWithAttachments();\n\n    return board.items.filter(item => {\n      if (query && !item.title.toLowerCase().includes(query) && !item.content.toLowerCase().includes(query)) {\n        return false;\n      }\n      if (gFilter !== 'all') {\n        if (gFilter === 'ungrouped' && item.groupId !== null) return false;\n        if (gFilter !== 'ungrouped' && item.groupId !== gFilter) return false;\n      }\n      if (pinnedOnly && !item.isPinned) return false;\n      if (withAtts && (!item.attachments || item.attachments.length === 0)) return false;\n      return true;\n    });\n  });\n\n  // Grouped items mapping\n  readonly itemsByGroup = computed(() => {\n    const items = this.filteredItems();\n    const map = new Map<string, MuralItem[]>();\n    for (const item of items) {\n      const key = item.groupId || 'ungrouped';\n      const list = map.get(key) || [];\n      list.push(item);\n      map.set(key, list);\n    }\n    return map;\n  });\n\n  readonly ungroupedItems = computed(() => {\n    return this.itemsByGroup().get('ungrouped') || [];\n  });\n\n  constructor() {\n    this.route.paramMap.subscribe(params => {\n      const boardId = params.get('boardId');\n      if (boardId && this.auth.currentUser()?.id) {\n        if (this.activeBoard()?.id !== boardId) {\n          this.muralService.loadBoard(boardId);\n        }\n      }\n    });\n  }\n\n  ngOnInit(): void {\n    const requestedId = this.route.snapshot.paramMap.get('boardId');\n    if (this.auth.currentUser()?.id) {\n      this.muralService.loadBoards(requestedId || undefined);\n      this.kanbanService.loadTeams();\n    }\n\n    this.unsubscribeRealtime = this.syncService.subscribe(event => {\n      if (event.type === 'mural_updated') {\n        const active = this.activeBoard();\n        if (active && active.id === event.muralId) {\n          this.muralService.loadBoard(active.id);\n        } else {\n          this.muralService.loadBoards();\n        }\n      } else if (event.type === 'mural_deleted') {\n        this.muralService.loadBoards();\n      }\n    });\n  }\n\n  ngOnDestroy(): void {\n    this.unsubscribeRealtime?.();\n    this.fecharPreview();\n  }\n\n  selecionarMural(boardId: string): void {\n    void this.router.navigate(['/mural', boardId]);\n    this.muralService.loadBoard(boardId);\n  }\n\n  abrirNovoItem(groupId: string | null = null): void {\n    this.closeMuralItemContextMenu();\n    this.itemModalReadOnly.set(false);\n    this.editingItem.set(null);\n    this.targetGroupId.set(groupId);\n    this.itemModalOpen.set(true);\n  }\n\n  abrirVisualizarItem(item: MuralItem): void {\n    this.closeMuralItemContextMenu();\n    this.itemModalReadOnly.set(true);\n    this.editingItem.set(item);\n    this.targetGroupId.set(item.groupId);\n    this.itemModalOpen.set(true);\n  }\n\n  abrirEditarItem(item: MuralItem): void {\n    this.closeMuralItemContextMenu();\n    this.itemModalReadOnly.set(false);\n    this.editingItem.set(item);\n    this.targetGroupId.set(item.groupId);\n    this.itemModalOpen.set(true);\n  }\n\n  openMuralItemContextMenu(event: MouseEvent, item: MuralItem): void {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    event.stopPropagation();\n    this.muralItemContextMenu.set({\n      item,\n      x: Math.max(8, Math.min(event.clientX, window.innerWidth - 200)),\n      y: Math.max(8, Math.min(event.clientY, window.innerHeight - 190)),\n    });\n  }\n\n  closeMuralItemContextMenu(): void {\n    this.muralItemContextMenu.set(null);\n  }\n\n  excluirItemFromContext(item: MuralItem): void {\n    this.closeMuralItemContextMenu();\n    this.apiService.excluirItem(item.id, this.currentUserId).subscribe({\n      next: () => this.onItemExcluido(item.id),\n      error: (err) => console.error('Erro ao excluir nota:', err)\n    });\n  }\n\n  fecharItemModal(): void {\n    this.itemModalOpen.set(false);\n    this.itemModalReadOnly.set(false);\n    this.editingItem.set(null);\n    this.targetGroupId.set(null);\n  }\n\n  onItemSalvo(savedItem: MuralItem): void {\n    const active = this.activeBoard();\n    if (!active) return;\n    const exists = active.items.some(i => i.id === savedItem.id);\n    if (exists) {\n      this.activeBoard.update(curr => curr ? {\n        ...curr,\n        items: curr.items.map(i => i.id === savedItem.id ? savedItem : i)\n      } : null);\n    } else {\n      this.activeBoard.update(curr => curr ? {\n        ...curr,\n        items: [savedItem, ...curr.items]\n      } : null);\n    }\n  }\n\n  onItemContentChange(item: MuralItem, newContent: string): void {\n    item.content = newContent;\n    this.apiService.atualizarItem(item.id, { content: newContent }, this.currentUserId).subscribe({\n      next: (updated) => {\n        this.onItemSalvo({ ...item, ...updated, content: newContent });\n      },\n      error: (err) => console.error('Erro ao atualizar checklist do cartão:', err),\n    });\n  }\n\n  onItemExcluido(itemId: string): void {\n    this.activeBoard.update(curr => curr ? {\n      ...curr,\n      items: curr.items.filter(i => i.id !== itemId)\n    } : null);\n  }\n\n  alternarFixacao(event: MouseEvent, item: MuralItem): void {\n    event.stopPropagation();\n    const novoEstado = !item.isPinned;\n    this.apiService.alternarFixacao(item.id, novoEstado, this.currentUserId).subscribe({\n      next: (updated) => {\n        this.activeBoard.update(curr => curr ? {\n          ...curr,\n          items: curr.items.map(i => i.id === item.id ? { ...i, isPinned: novoEstado } : i)\n        } : null);\n      },\n      error: (err) => {\n        console.error('Erro ao alternar fixação:', err);\n      }\n    });\n  }\n\n  // Group modal management\n  abrirNovoGrupo(): void {\n    this.editingGroup.set(null);\n    this.groupTitle = '';\n    this.groupColor = '#64748b';\n    this.groupModalOpen.set(true);\n  }\n\n  abrirEditarGrupo(group: MuralGroup, event: MouseEvent): void {\n    event.stopPropagation();\n    this.editingGroup.set(group);\n    this.groupTitle = group.title;\n    this.groupColor = group.color;\n    this.groupModalOpen.set(true);\n  }\n\n  fecharGrupoModal(): void {\n    this.groupModalOpen.set(false);\n    this.editingGroup.set(null);\n    this.confirmDeleteGroup.set(false);\n  }\n\n  salvarGrupo(): void {\n    const active = this.activeBoard();\n    if (!active || this.loadingSalvarGrupo || !this.groupTitle.trim()) return;\n\n    this.loadingSalvarGrupo = true;\n    const editGroup = this.editingGroup();\n\n    if (editGroup) {\n      this.apiService.atualizarGrupo(editGroup.id, {\n        title: this.groupTitle.trim(),\n        color: this.groupColor,\n      }, this.currentUserId)\n        .pipe(finalize(() => { this.loadingSalvarGrupo = false; }))\n        .subscribe({\n          next: (updated) => {\n            this.activeBoard.update(curr => curr ? {\n              ...curr,\n              groups: curr.groups.map(g => g.id === editGroup.id ? updated : g)\n            } : null);\n            this.fecharGrupoModal();\n          },\n          error: (err) => console.error('Erro ao atualizar grupo:', err)\n        });\n    } else {\n      this.apiService.salvarGrupo(active.id, {\n        title: this.groupTitle.trim(),\n        color: this.groupColor,\n      }, this.currentUserId)\n        .pipe(finalize(() => { this.loadingSalvarGrupo = false; }))\n        .subscribe({\n          next: (created) => {\n            this.activeBoard.update(curr => curr ? {\n              ...curr,\n              groups: [...curr.groups, created]\n            } : null);\n            this.fecharGrupoModal();\n          },\n          error: (err) => console.error('Erro ao criar grupo:', err)\n        });\n    }\n  }\n\n  solicitarExclusaoGrupo(): void {\n    this.confirmDeleteGroup.set(true);\n  }\n\n  solicitarExclusaoGrupoDireto(group: MuralGroup, event: MouseEvent): void {\n    event.stopPropagation();\n    this.editingGroup.set(group);\n    this.groupTitle = group.title;\n    this.groupColor = group.color;\n    this.confirmDeleteGroup.set(true);\n    this.groupModalOpen.set(true);\n  }\n\n  cancelarExclusaoGrupo(): void {\n    this.confirmDeleteGroup.set(false);\n  }\n\n  confirmarExclusaoGrupo(): void {\n    const editGroup = this.editingGroup();\n    if (!editGroup || this.loadingExcluirGrupo) return;\n\n    this.loadingExcluirGrupo = true;\n    this.apiService.excluirGrupo(editGroup.id, this.currentUserId)\n      .pipe(finalize(() => { this.loadingExcluirGrupo = false; }))\n      .subscribe({\n        next: () => {\n          this.activeBoard.update(curr => curr ? {\n            ...curr,\n            groups: curr.groups.filter(g => g.id !== editGroup.id),\n            items: curr.items.map(i => i.groupId === editGroup.id ? { ...i, groupId: null } : i)\n          } : null);\n          this.fecharGrupoModal();\n        },\n        error: (err) => console.error('Erro ao excluir grupo:', err)\n      });\n  }\n\n  isFirstGroup(group: MuralGroup): boolean {\n    const groups = this.activeBoard()?.groups || [];\n    return groups.length > 0 && groups[0].id === group.id;\n  }\n\n  isLastGroup(group: MuralGroup): boolean {\n    const groups = this.activeBoard()?.groups || [];\n    return groups.length > 0 && groups[groups.length - 1].id === group.id;\n  }\n\n  onGroupDropped(event: CdkDragDrop<MuralGroup[]>): void {\n    const active = this.activeBoard();\n    if (!active || !active.groups || event.previousIndex === event.currentIndex) return;\n    const updatedGroups = [...active.groups];\n    moveItemInArray(updatedGroups, event.previousIndex, event.currentIndex);\n    updatedGroups.forEach((grp, idx) => { grp.position = idx; });\n    this.activeBoard.update(curr => curr ? { ...curr, groups: updatedGroups } : null);\n\n    const groupIds = updatedGroups.map(g => g.id);\n    this.apiService.reordenarGrupos(active.id, groupIds, this.currentUserId).subscribe({\n      error: (err) => console.error('Erro ao reordenar grupos:', err)\n    });\n  }\n\n  moverGrupo(group: MuralGroup, delta: number, event?: Event): void {\n    event?.stopPropagation();\n    const active = this.activeBoard();\n    if (!active || !active.groups) return;\n    const index = active.groups.findIndex(g => g.id === group.id);\n    if (index === -1) return;\n    const newIndex = index + delta;\n    if (newIndex < 0 || newIndex >= active.groups.length) return;\n\n    const updatedGroups = [...active.groups];\n    moveItemInArray(updatedGroups, index, newIndex);\n    updatedGroups.forEach((grp, idx) => { grp.position = idx; });\n    this.activeBoard.update(curr => curr ? { ...curr, groups: updatedGroups } : null);\n\n    const groupIds = updatedGroups.map(g => g.id);\n    this.apiService.reordenarGrupos(active.id, groupIds, this.currentUserId).subscribe({\n      error: (err) => console.error('Erro ao reordenar grupos:', err)\n    });\n  }\n\n  onBoardDropped(event: CdkDragDrop<MuralBoardSummary[]>): void {\n    if (event.previousIndex === event.currentIndex) return;\n    const allBoards = [...this.boards()];\n    moveItemInArray(allBoards, event.previousIndex, event.currentIndex);\n    allBoards.forEach((b, idx) => { b.position = idx; });\n    this.boards.set(allBoards);\n\n    const boardIds = allBoards.map(b => b.id);\n    this.apiService.reordenarMurais(boardIds, this.currentUserId).subscribe({\n      error: (err) => console.error('Erro ao reordenar murais:', err)\n    });\n  }\n\n  // Board modal management\n  abrirNovoMural(scopeType: 'personal' | 'team' = 'personal', teamId: string | null = null): void {\n    this.newBoardName = '';\n    this.newBoardDescription = '';\n    this.newBoardColor = '#f59e0b';\n    this.newBoardScopeType = scopeType;\n    this.newBoardTeamId = teamId;\n    this.createBoardModalOpen.set(true);\n  }\n\n  fecharNovoMuralModal(): void {\n    this.createBoardModalOpen.set(false);\n  }\n\n  salvarNovoMural(): void {\n    if (!this.newBoardName.trim() || this.loadingCriarMural) return;\n\n    this.loadingCriarMural = true;\n    this.apiService.salvarMural({\n      name: this.newBoardName.trim(),\n      description: this.newBoardDescription,\n      color: this.newBoardColor,\n      scopeType: this.newBoardScopeType,\n      teamId: this.newBoardTeamId,\n    }, this.currentUserId)\n      .pipe(finalize(() => { this.loadingCriarMural = false; }))\n      .subscribe({\n        next: (created) => {\n          this.boards.update(list => [...list, created]);\n          this.fecharNovoMuralModal();\n          this.selecionarMural(created.id);\n        },\n        error: (err) => console.error('Erro ao criar mural:', err)\n      });\n  }\n\n  abrirEditarMural(): void {\n    const active = this.activeBoard();\n    if (!active) return;\n    this.boardName = active.name;\n    this.boardDescription = active.description;\n    this.boardColor = active.color;\n    this.confirmDeleteBoard.set(false);\n    this.boardModalOpen.set(true);\n  }\n\n  fecharBoardModal(): void {\n    this.boardModalOpen.set(false);\n    this.confirmDeleteBoard.set(false);\n  }\n\n  salvarMural(): void {\n    const active = this.activeBoard();\n    if (!active || this.loadingSalvarMural || !this.boardName.trim()) return;\n\n    this.loadingSalvarMural = true;\n    this.apiService.atualizarMural(active.id, {\n      name: this.boardName.trim(),\n      description: this.boardDescription,\n      color: this.boardColor,\n    }, this.currentUserId)\n      .pipe(finalize(() => { this.loadingSalvarMural = false; }))\n      .subscribe({\n        next: (updated) => {\n          this.activeBoard.update(curr => curr ? { ...curr, ...updated } : null);\n          this.boards.update(list => list.map(b => b.id === active.id ? { ...b, ...updated } : b));\n          this.fecharBoardModal();\n        },\n        error: (err) => console.error('Erro ao atualizar mural:', err)\n      });\n  }\n\n  solicitarExclusaoMural(): void {\n    this.confirmDeleteBoard.set(true);\n  }\n\n  cancelarExclusaoMural(): void {\n    this.confirmDeleteBoard.set(false);\n  }\n\n  confirmarExclusaoMural(): void {\n    const active = this.activeBoard();\n    if (!active || this.loadingExcluirMural) return;\n\n    this.loadingExcluirMural = true;\n    this.apiService.excluirMural(active.id, this.currentUserId)\n      .pipe(finalize(() => { this.loadingExcluirMural = false; }))\n      .subscribe({\n        next: () => {\n          const remaining = this.boards().filter(b => b.id !== active.id);\n          this.boards.set(remaining);\n          this.confirmDeleteBoard.set(false);\n          this.fecharBoardModal();\n          if (remaining.length) {\n            this.selecionarMural(remaining[0].id);\n          } else {\n            this.muralService.loadBoards();\n          }\n        },\n        error: (err) => console.error('Erro ao excluir mural:', err)\n      });\n  }\n\n  excluirMuralPorId(board: MuralBoardSummary, event?: Event): void {\n    event?.stopPropagation();\n    if (!confirm(`Deseja excluir o mural \"${board.name}\" e todas as suas notas? Esta ação não pode ser desfeita.`)) return;\n\n    this.apiService.excluirMural(board.id, this.currentUserId).subscribe({\n      next: () => {\n        const remaining = this.boards().filter(b => b.id !== board.id);\n        this.boards.set(remaining);\n        if (this.activeBoard()?.id === board.id) {\n          if (remaining.length) {\n            this.selecionarMural(remaining[0].id);\n          } else {\n            this.muralService.loadBoards();\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      error: (err) => console.error('Erro ao excluir mural:', err)\n    });\n  }\n\n  // ══ Drag & Drop ══\n  onDragStart(event: DragEvent, item: MuralItem): void {\n    this.draggingItem = item;\n    this.draggingItemId = item.id;\n    if (event.dataTransfer) {\n      event.dataTransfer.effectAllowed = 'move';\n      event.dataTransfer.setData('text/plain', item.id);\n    }\n  }\n\n  onDragEnd(): void {\n    this.draggingItemId = null;\n    this.draggingItem = null;\n    this.dragOverGroupId = null;\n  }\n\n  onGroupDragOver(event: DragEvent, groupId: string): void {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    if (event.dataTransfer) event.dataTransfer.dropEffect = 'move';\n    this.dragOverGroupId = groupId;\n  }\n\n  onGroupDragLeave(): void {\n    this.dragOverGroupId = null;\n  }\n\n  onDropInGroup(event: DragEvent, groupId: string | null): void {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    this.dragOverGroupId = null;\n    const item = this.draggingItem;\n    if (!item || item.groupId === groupId) return;\n\n    // Optimistic update\n    this.activeBoard.update(curr => curr ? {\n      ...curr,\n      items: curr.items.map(i => i.id === item.id ? { ...i, groupId } : i)\n    } : null);\n\n    // Persist\n    this.apiService.moverItemParaGrupo(item.id, groupId, this.currentUserId).subscribe({\n      error: (err) => {\n        console.error('Erro ao mover item:', err);\n        // Rollback\n        this.activeBoard.update(curr => curr ? {\n          ...curr,\n          items: curr.items.map(i => i.id === item.id ? { ...i, groupId: item.groupId } : i)\n        } : null);\n      }\n    });\n\n    this.draggingItem = null;\n    this.draggingItemId = null;\n  }\n\n  // ══ Team Management (Exato ao Tarefas) ══\n  abrirCriarTime(): void {\n    this.newTeamName = '';\n    this.newTeamDescription = '';\n    this.newTeamColor = '#4f46e5';\n    this.creatingTeam.set(true);\n    this.teamModalOpen.set(true);\n  }\n\n  abrirGerenciarTime(teamId?: string): void {\n    const targetTeamId = teamId || this.activeBoard()?.teamId || this.teams()[0]?.id;\n    if (targetTeamId) {\n      this.kanbanService.loadTeamMembers(targetTeamId);\n    }\n    this.creatingTeam.set(false);\n    this.invitedUserId = '';\n    this.teamModalOpen.set(true);\n  }\n\n  fecharTimeModal(): void {\n    this.teamModalOpen.set(false);\n    this.confirmDeleteTeam.set(false);\n  }\n\n  trocarTimeNoModal(teamId: string): void {\n    this.confirmDeleteTeam.set(false);\n    this.kanbanService.loadTeamMembers(teamId);\n    const targetMural = this.boards().find(b => b.teamId === teamId);\n    if (targetMural) {\n      this.muralService.loadBoard(targetMural.id);\n    }\n  }\n\n  saveTeam(): void {\n    const name = this.newTeamName.trim();\n    if (name) {\n      this.kanbanService.createTeam(name, this.newTeamDescription.trim(), this.newTeamColor);\n      setTimeout(() => {\n        this.muralService.loadBoards();\n      }, 500);\n    }\n    this.newTeamName = '';\n    this.newTeamDescription = '';\n    this.creatingTeam.set(false);\n    this.teamModalOpen.set(false);\n  }\n\n  inviteMember(): void {\n    const team = this.currentTeam();\n    if (!team || !this.invitedUserId) return;\n    this.kanbanService.inviteToTeam(team.id, this.invitedUserId);\n    this.invitedUserId = '';\n  }\n\n  removeMember(memberId: string): void {\n    const team = this.currentTeam();\n    if (!team) return;\n    this.kanbanService.removeTeamMember(team.id, memberId);\n  }\n\n  changeMemberRole(memberId: string, role: 'admin' | 'member'): void {\n    const team = this.currentTeam();\n    if (!team) return;\n    this.kanbanService.changeTeamMemberRole(team.id, memberId, role);\n  }\n\n  isTeamOwner(userId: string): boolean {\n    return this.currentTeam()?.owner_id === userId;\n  }\n\n  solicitarExclusaoTime(): void {\n    this.confirmDeleteTeam.set(true);\n  }\n\n  cancelarExclusaoTime(): void {\n    this.confirmDeleteTeam.set(false);\n  }\n\n  confirmarExclusaoTime(): void {\n    const team = this.currentTeam();\n    if (!team) return;\n    this.kanbanService.deleteTeam(team.id, (success) => {\n      if (success) {\n        this.confirmDeleteTeam.set(false);\n        this.teamModalOpen.set(false);\n        this.muralService.loadBoards();\n      }\n    });\n  }\n\n  memberName(userId: string): string {\n    if (userId === this.auth.currentUser()?.id) return this.auth.currentUser()?.name || 'Você';\n    return this.auth.allUsers().find(user => user.id === userId)?.name || userId;\n  }\n\n  memberAvatar(userId: string): string {\n    if (userId === this.auth.currentUser()?.id) return this.auth.currentUser()?.avatar || this.defaultAvatar;\n    return this.auth.allUsers().find(user => user.id === userId)?.avatar || this.defaultAvatar;\n  }\n\n  getFileInfo(name: string, mime?: string) {\n    return detectFileType(name, mime);\n  }\n\n  // Attachment preview in board\n  abrirPreview(event: MouseEvent, att: Attachment): void {\n    event.stopPropagation();\n    const fileInfo = detectFileType(att.fileName, att.mimeType);\n    this.previewCurrentAttachment.set(att);\n    this.previewAttachmentName.set(att.fileName);\n    this.previewAttachmentMimeType.set(att.mimeType);\n    this.previewAttachmentByteSize.set(att.byteSize);\n\n    if (fileInfo.category === 'code' || fileInfo.category === 'other' || att.mimeType.startsWith('text/')) {\n      this.attachmentsService.text(att.id, this.currentUserId).subscribe({\n        next: (text) => {\n          this.previewAttachmentRawContent.set(text);\n          this.attachmentsService.content(att.id, this.currentUserId).subscribe({\n            next: (blob) => {\n              const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n              this.previewAttachmentUrl.set(url);\n            }\n          });\n        },\n        error: () => {\n          this.attachmentsService.content(att.id, this.currentUserId).subscribe({\n            next: (blob) => {\n              const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n              this.previewAttachmentUrl.set(url);\n            }\n          });\n        }\n      });\n    } else {\n      this.previewAttachmentRawContent.set(null);\n      this.attachmentsService.content(att.id, this.currentUserId).subscribe({\n        next: (blob) => {\n          const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n          this.previewAttachmentUrl.set(url);\n        },\n        error: (err) => console.error('Erro ao carregar preview do anexo:', err)\n      });\n    }\n  }\n\n  fecharPreview(): void {\n    const current = this.previewAttachmentUrl();\n    if (current) URL.revokeObjectURL(current);\n    this.previewAttachmentUrl.set(null);\n    this.previewAttachmentName.set('');\n    this.previewAttachmentMimeType.set('');\n    this.previewAttachmentRawContent.set(null);\n    this.previewAttachmentByteSize.set(undefined);\n    this.previewCurrentAttachment.set(null);\n  }\n\n  baixarAnexo(att?: Attachment | null): void {\n    const target = att || this.previewCurrentAttachment();\n    if (!target) return;\n    this.attachmentsService.content(target.id, this.currentUserId).subscribe({\n      next: (blob) => {\n        const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n        const a = document.createElement('a');\n        a.href = url;\n        a.download = target.fileName;\n        a.click();\n        URL.revokeObjectURL(url);\n      }\n    });\n  }\n\n  formatarData(isoString: string): string {\n    if (!isoString) return '';\n    try {\n      const d = new Date(isoString);\n      const dia = d.getDate().toString().padStart(2, '0');\n      const mes = (d.getMonth() + 1).toString().padStart(2, '0');\n      const hora = d.getHours().toString().padStart(2, '0');\n      const min = d.getMinutes().toString().padStart(2, '0');\n      return `${dia}/${mes} às ${hora}:${min}`;\n    } catch {\n      return isoString;\n    }\n  }\n}\n","<div class=\"mural-shell\">\n\n  <!-- ══════════════ TOOLBAR ══════════════ -->\n  <div class=\"mural-toolbar group-panel\">\n\n    <div class=\"toolbar-left\">\n      <!-- Board Selector com Angular Material Menu -->\n      <div class=\"board-selector-wrapper\">\n        <button\n          type=\"button\"\n          class=\"mat-board-trigger\"\n          [matMenuTriggerFor]=\"muralMenu\"\n          aria-label=\"Selecionar Mural\"\n        >\n          <div class=\"board-mark\" [style.background]=\"activeBoard()?.color || '#f59e0b'\">\n            <mat-icon>{{ activeBoard()?.scopeType === 'team' ? 'groups' : 'space_dashboard' }}</mat-icon>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"board-heading\">\n            <div class=\"board-title-row\">\n              <span class=\"board-active-name\">{{ activeBoard()?.name || 'Selecionar Mural' }}</span>\n              <span class=\"board-items-badge\" *ngIf=\"activeBoard()?.items?.length\">({{ activeBoard()?.items?.length }})</span>\n              <mat-icon class=\"dropdown-chevron\">expand_more</mat-icon>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"board-subtitle\" *ngIf=\"activeBoard()?.scopeType === 'team'\">\n              {{ activeBoard()?.teamName || 'Mural do Time' }}\n            </span>\n          </div>\n        </button>\n\n        <mat-menu #muralMenu=\"matMenu\" class=\"mural-custom-mat-menu\" xPosition=\"after\">\n          <!-- Cabeçalho do Menu / Ações Rápidas -->\n          <div class=\"mat-menu-header\" (click)=\"$event.stopPropagation()\">\n            <span class=\"menu-header-title\">Murais & Espaços</span>\n            <div class=\"mat-menu-header-actions\">\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"mat-menu-action-btn\" (click)=\"abrirNovoMural('personal')\" matTooltip=\"Criar novo mural pessoal\">\n                <mat-icon>dashboard_customize</mat-icon><span>Novo Mural</span>\n              </button>\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"mat-menu-action-btn\" (click)=\"abrirCriarTime()\" matTooltip=\"Criar novo time\">\n                <mat-icon>add</mat-icon><span>Novo Time</span>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"menu-dnd-list\" cdkDropList (cdkDropListDropped)=\"onBoardDropped($event)\">\n            <!-- Murais Pessoais -->\n            <div class=\"mat-menu-group-label\" *ngIf=\"hasPersonalBoards()\">\n              <mat-icon>person</mat-icon>\n              <span>Pessoal</span>\n            </div>\n            <ng-container *ngFor=\"let b of boards()\">\n              <div\n                class=\"menu-board-row\"\n                *ngIf=\"b.scopeType === 'personal'\"\n                cdkDrag\n                [cdkDragData]=\"b\"\n                [class.active-row]=\"b.id === activeBoard()?.id\"\n              >\n                <mat-icon class=\"menu-drag-icon\" cdkDragHandle matTooltip=\"Arraste para reordenar\">drag_indicator</mat-icon>\n                <button\n                  type=\"button\"\n                  class=\"menu-board-btn\"\n                  (click)=\"selecionarMural(b.id)\"\n                >\n                  <span class=\"menu-board-dot\" [style.background]=\"b.color\"></span>\n                  <span class=\"menu-board-title\">{{ b.name }}</span>\n                  <span class=\"menu-board-count\" *ngIf=\"b.itemCount\">({{ b.itemCount }})</span>\n                  <mat-icon *ngIf=\"b.id === activeBoard()?.id\" class=\"menu-check-icon\">check</mat-icon>\n                </button>\n                <div class=\"menu-row-actions\" (click)=\"$event.stopPropagation()\">\n                  <button type=\"button\" class=\"menu-action-btn\" (click)=\"selecionarMural(b.id); abrirEditarMural()\" matTooltip=\"Configurar Mural\">\n                    <mat-icon>settings</mat-icon>\n                  </button>\n                  <button type=\"button\" class=\"menu-action-btn danger\" *ngIf=\"boards().length > 1\" (click)=\"excluirMuralPorId(b, $event)\" matTooltip=\"Excluir Mural\">\n                    <mat-icon>delete_outline</mat-icon>\n                  </button>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </ng-container>\n\n            <!-- Murais de Time -->\n            <div class=\"mat-menu-group-label\" *ngIf=\"hasTeamBoards()\">\n              <mat-icon>groups</mat-icon>\n              <span>Times & Equipes</span>\n            </div>\n            <ng-container *ngFor=\"let b of boards()\">\n              <div\n                class=\"menu-board-row\"\n                *ngIf=\"b.scopeType === 'team'\"\n                cdkDrag\n                [cdkDragData]=\"b\"\n                [class.active-row]=\"b.id === activeBoard()?.id\"\n              >\n                <mat-icon class=\"menu-drag-icon\" cdkDragHandle matTooltip=\"Arraste para reordenar\">drag_indicator</mat-icon>\n                <button\n                  type=\"button\"\n                  class=\"menu-board-btn\"\n                  (click)=\"selecionarMural(b.id)\"\n                >\n                  <span class=\"menu-board-dot\" [style.background]=\"b.color\"></span>\n                  <span class=\"menu-board-title\">{{ b.name }}</span>\n                  <span class=\"menu-board-count\" *ngIf=\"b.itemCount\">({{ b.itemCount }})</span>\n                  <mat-icon *ngIf=\"b.id === activeBoard()?.id\" class=\"menu-check-icon\">check</mat-icon>\n                </button>\n                <div class=\"menu-row-actions\" (click)=\"$event.stopPropagation()\">\n                  <button type=\"button\" class=\"menu-action-btn\" *ngIf=\"b.myRole === 'admin'\" (click)=\"selecionarMural(b.id); abrirEditarMural()\" matTooltip=\"Configurar Mural\">\n                    <mat-icon>settings</mat-icon>\n                  </button>\n                  <button type=\"button\" class=\"menu-action-btn danger\" *ngIf=\"b.myRole === 'admin'\" (click)=\"excluirMuralPorId(b, $event)\" matTooltip=\"Excluir Mural\">\n                    <mat-icon>delete_outline</mat-icon>\n                  </button>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </ng-container>\n          </div>\n        </mat-menu>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Busca -->\n      <div class=\"search-box\">\n        <mat-icon>search</mat-icon>\n        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Buscar no mural...\" [ngModel]=\"search()\" (ngModelChange)=\"search.set($event)\" />\n        <button *ngIf=\"search()\" class=\"icon-btn\" (click)=\"search.set('')\"><mat-icon>close</mat-icon></button>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Filtros -->\n      <button class=\"archive-toggle expand-pill-btn size-34\" [class.active]=\"filterPinnedOnly()\" (click)=\"filterPinnedOnly.set(!filterPinnedOnly())\" matTooltip=\"Fixados\">\n        <mat-icon>push_pin</mat-icon><span class=\"pill-label\">Fixados</span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"archive-toggle expand-pill-btn size-34\" [class.active]=\"filterWithAttachments()\" (click)=\"filterWithAttachments.set(!filterWithAttachments())\" matTooltip=\"Com Anexos\">\n        <mat-icon>attach_file</mat-icon><span class=\"pill-label\">Com Anexos</span>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"toolbar-actions\">\n      <button class=\"secondary-btn expand-pill-btn size-36\" (click)=\"abrirNovoMural('personal')\" matTooltip=\"Criar novo mural pessoal\">\n        <mat-icon>dashboard_customize</mat-icon><span class=\"pill-label\">Novo Mural</span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"secondary-btn expand-pill-btn size-36\" (click)=\"abrirNovoGrupo()\" matTooltip=\"Criar novo quadro de cartões\">\n        <mat-icon>create_new_folder</mat-icon><span class=\"pill-label\">Novo Quadro</span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"primary-btn expand-pill-btn size-36 primary-pill\" (click)=\"abrirNovoItem()\" matTooltip=\"Novo Cartão no Mural\">\n        <mat-icon>add</mat-icon><span class=\"pill-label\">Novo Cartão</span>\n      </button>\n      <button *ngIf=\"activeBoard()?.myRole === 'admin'\" class=\"secondary-btn expand-pill-btn size-36\" (click)=\"abrirEditarMural()\" matTooltip=\"Configurar / Excluir Mural\">\n        <mat-icon>settings</mat-icon><span class=\"pill-label\">Configurações</span>\n      </button>\n      <button *ngIf=\"activeBoard()?.scopeType === 'team' || teams().length > 0\" class=\"secondary-btn expand-pill-btn size-36\" (click)=\"abrirGerenciarTime()\" matTooltip=\"Gerenciar Time & Membros SSO\">\n        <mat-icon>group</mat-icon><span class=\"pill-label\">Membros</span>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ══════════════ CANVAS ══════════════ -->\n  <div class=\"mural-canvas\" [class.is-loading]=\"loading()\" (click)=\"closeMuralItemContextMenu()\" (dragover)=\"$event.preventDefault()\">\n\n    <!-- Grupos / Quadros do Mural Reordenáveis por Drag & Drop -->\n    <div\n      class=\"mural-groups-row\"\n      *ngIf=\"activeBoard()?.groups?.length\"\n      cdkDropList\n      cdkDropListOrientation=\"horizontal\"\n      (cdkDropListDropped)=\"onGroupDropped($event)\"\n    >\n      <div\n        *ngFor=\"let group of activeBoard()?.groups\"\n        class=\"mural-group-frame\"\n        cdkDrag\n        [cdkDragData]=\"group\"\n        [style.--group-color]=\"group.color\"\n        [class.drag-over]=\"dragOverGroupId === group.id\"\n        (dragover)=\"onGroupDragOver($event, group.id)\"\n        (dragleave)=\"onGroupDragLeave()\"\n        (drop)=\"onDropInGroup($event, group.id)\"\n      >\n        <div class=\"drag-placeholder group-drag-placeholder\" *cdkDragPlaceholder></div>\n        <div class=\"group-header\">\n          <div class=\"group-title-box\">\n            <mat-icon class=\"group-drag-handle\" cdkDragHandle matTooltip=\"Arraste para reordenar este quadro\">drag_indicator</mat-icon>\n            <span class=\"column-accent\" [style.background]=\"group.color\" [style.box-shadow]=\"'0 0 7px ' + group.color\"></span>\n            <span class=\"column-title\">{{ group.title }}</span>\n            <span class=\"column-count\">{{ (itemsByGroup().get(group.id) || []).length }}</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"group-actions\">\n            <button class=\"icon-btn\" (click)=\"moverGrupo(group, -1, $event)\" [disabled]=\"isFirstGroup(group)\" matTooltip=\"Mover para esquerda\"><mat-icon>chevron_left</mat-icon></button>\n            <button class=\"icon-btn\" (click)=\"moverGrupo(group, 1, $event)\" [disabled]=\"isLastGroup(group)\" matTooltip=\"Mover para direita\"><mat-icon>chevron_right</mat-icon></button>\n            <button class=\"icon-btn\" (click)=\"abrirNovoItem(group.id)\" matTooltip=\"Adicionar cartão\"><mat-icon>add</mat-icon></button>\n            <button *ngIf=\"activeBoard()?.myRole === 'admin'\" class=\"icon-btn\" (click)=\"abrirEditarGrupo(group, $event)\" matTooltip=\"Editar quadro\"><mat-icon>edit</mat-icon></button>\n            <button *ngIf=\"activeBoard()?.myRole === 'admin'\" class=\"icon-btn danger-hover\" (click)=\"solicitarExclusaoGrupoDireto(group, $event)\" matTooltip=\"Excluir quadro\"><mat-icon>delete_outline</mat-icon></button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"group-items-grid\">\n          <div\n            *ngFor=\"let item of (itemsByGroup().get(group.id) || [])\"\n            class=\"sticky-card\"\n            [style.background]=\"item.color\"\n            [class.pinned]=\"item.isPinned\"\n            [class.dragging]=\"draggingItemId === item.id\"\n            draggable=\"true\"\n            (dragstart)=\"onDragStart($event, item)\"\n            (dragend)=\"onDragEnd()\"\n            (click)=\"abrirVisualizarItem(item)\"\n            (contextmenu)=\"openMuralItemContextMenu($event, item)\"\n          >\n            <div class=\"card-pin\" [class.active]=\"item.isPinned\" (click)=\"alternarFixacao($event, item)\" matTooltip=\"{{ item.isPinned ? 'Desafixar' : 'Fixar' }}\">\n              <mat-icon>push_pin</mat-icon>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card-header-row\">\n              <h4 class=\"card-title\">{{ item.title }}</h4>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card-body\" *ngIf=\"item.content\">\n              <app-markdown-text [text]=\"item.content\" (textChange)=\"onItemContentChange(item, $event)\"></app-markdown-text>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card-attachments-chips\" *ngIf=\"item.attachments?.length\">\n              <span\n                *ngFor=\"let att of item.attachments\"\n                class=\"att-chip\"\n                [ngClass]=\"'chip-' + getFileInfo(att.fileName, att.mimeType).category\"\n                (click)=\"abrirPreview($event, att)\"\n              >\n                <mat-icon [style.color]=\"getFileInfo(att.fileName, att.mimeType).color\">{{ getFileInfo(att.fileName, att.mimeType).icon }}</mat-icon>\n                <span>{{ att.fileName }}</span>\n              </span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card-footer\">\n              <span class=\"card-author\" *ngIf=\"item.createdByName\">\n                <mat-icon>person</mat-icon>{{ item.createdByName }}\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"card-date\">{{ formatarData(item.createdAt) }}</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Empty group placeholder (drop target) -->\n          <div class=\"empty-group-placeholder\" *ngIf=\"!(itemsByGroup().get(group.id) || []).length\" (click)=\"abrirNovoItem(group.id)\">\n            <mat-icon>note_add</mat-icon>\n            <span>Clique ou arraste um cartão aqui</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Notas Soltas -->\n    <div class=\"mural-ungrouped-section\"\n      *ngIf=\"ungroupedItems().length || !activeBoard()?.groups?.length\"\n      [class.drag-over]=\"dragOverGroupId === 'ungrouped'\"\n      (dragover)=\"onGroupDragOver($event, 'ungrouped')\"\n      (dragleave)=\"onGroupDragLeave()\"\n      (drop)=\"onDropInGroup($event, null)\"\n    >\n      <div class=\"section-title-divider\">\n        <mat-icon>push_pin</mat-icon>\n        <span>Notas & Avisos Soltos no Mural</span>\n        <span class=\"column-count\" *ngIf=\"ungroupedItems().length\">{{ ungroupedItems().length }}</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"ungrouped-wall-grid\">\n        <div\n          *ngFor=\"let item of ungroupedItems()\"\n          class=\"sticky-card loose-card\"\n          [style.background]=\"item.color\"\n          [style.transform]=\"'rotate(' + item.rotation + 'deg)'\"\n          [class.pinned]=\"item.isPinned\"\n          [class.dragging]=\"draggingItemId === item.id\"\n          draggable=\"true\"\n          (dragstart)=\"onDragStart($event, item)\"\n          (dragend)=\"onDragEnd()\"\n          (click)=\"abrirVisualizarItem(item)\"\n          (contextmenu)=\"openMuralItemContextMenu($event, item)\"\n        >\n          <div class=\"card-pin\" [class.active]=\"item.isPinned\" (click)=\"alternarFixacao($event, item)\">\n            <mat-icon>push_pin</mat-icon>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"card-header-row\"><h4 class=\"card-title\">{{ item.title }}</h4></div>\n          <div class=\"card-body\" *ngIf=\"item.content\">\n            <app-markdown-text [text]=\"item.content\" (textChange)=\"onItemContentChange(item, $event)\"></app-markdown-text>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"card-attachments-chips\" *ngIf=\"item.attachments?.length\">\n            <span\n              *ngFor=\"let att of item.attachments\"\n              class=\"att-chip\"\n              [ngClass]=\"'chip-' + getFileInfo(att.fileName, att.mimeType).category\"\n              (click)=\"abrirPreview($event, att)\"\n            >\n              <mat-icon [style.color]=\"getFileInfo(att.fileName, att.mimeType).color\">{{ getFileInfo(att.fileName, att.mimeType).icon }}</mat-icon>\n              <span>{{ att.fileName }}</span>\n            </span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"card-footer\">\n            <span class=\"card-author\" *ngIf=\"item.createdByName\"><mat-icon>person</mat-icon>{{ item.createdByName }}</span>\n            <span class=\"card-date\">{{ formatarData(item.createdAt) }}</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Estado Vazio -->\n    <div class=\"mural-empty-state\" *ngIf=\"!loading() && !filteredItems().length && !activeBoard()?.groups?.length\">\n      <div class=\"empty-icon-box\"><mat-icon>sticky_note_2</mat-icon></div>\n      <h2>Mural pronto!</h2>\n      <p>Fixe comunicados, notas, fotos e documentos importantes no seu mural.</p>\n      <button class=\"primary-btn\" (click)=\"abrirNovoItem()\">\n        <mat-icon>add</mat-icon><span>Criar Primeira Nota</span>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ══════════════ MODAL DE ITEM ══════════════ -->\n<app-mural-item-modal\n  *ngIf=\"itemModalOpen()\"\n  [boardId]=\"activeBoard()?.id || ''\"\n  [item]=\"editingItem()\"\n  [groups]=\"activeBoard()?.groups || []\"\n  [defaultGroupId]=\"targetGroupId()\"\n  [isReadOnly]=\"itemModalReadOnly()\"\n  (close)=\"fecharItemModal()\"\n  (saved)=\"onItemSalvo($event)\"\n  (deleted)=\"onItemExcluido($event)\"\n></app-mural-item-modal>\n\n<!-- ══════════════ MENU DE CONTEXTO DO ITEM DO MURAL ══════════════ -->\n<div\n  class=\"mural-context-menu\"\n  *ngIf=\"muralItemContextMenu() as menu\"\n  [style.left.px]=\"menu.x\"\n  [style.top.px]=\"menu.y\"\n  (click)=\"$event.stopPropagation()\"\n>\n  <button type=\"button\" (click)=\"abrirVisualizarItem(menu.item)\">\n    <mat-icon>visibility</mat-icon><span>Visualizar</span>\n  </button>\n  <button type=\"button\" (click)=\"abrirEditarItem(menu.item)\">\n    <mat-icon>edit</mat-icon><span>Editar</span>\n  </button>\n  <button type=\"button\" (click)=\"alternarFixacao($event, menu.item)\">\n    <mat-icon>push_pin</mat-icon><span>{{ menu.item.isPinned ? 'Desafixar' : 'Fixar' }}</span>\n  </button>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"danger\" (click)=\"excluirItemFromContext(menu.item)\">\n    <mat-icon>delete_outline</mat-icon><span>Excluir</span>\n  </button>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ══════════════ MODAL DE GRUPO / QUADRO ══════════════ -->\n<div class=\"modal-overlay\" *ngIf=\"groupModalOpen()\" (mousedown)=\"fecharGrupoModal()\">\n  <div class=\"modal-card modal-sm\" (mousedown)=\"$event.stopPropagation()\">\n    <div class=\"modal-header\">\n      <div class=\"header-main\">\n        <div class=\"header-badge\" [style.background]=\"groupColor || '#64748b'\">\n          <mat-icon>{{ editingGroup() ? 'edit' : 'create_new_folder' }}</mat-icon>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h2>{{ editingGroup() ? 'Editar Quadro' : 'Novo Quadro no Mural' }}</h2>\n          <p>{{ editingGroup() ? 'Atualize o título e cor deste quadro.' : 'Crie uma seção temática para organizar cartões.' }}</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"close-btn\" (click)=\"fecharGrupoModal()\"><mat-icon>close</mat-icon></button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"modal-body\">\n      <div class=\"form-card\">\n        <div class=\"card-section-header\"><mat-icon class=\"color-blue\">folder</mat-icon><h3>Dados do Quadro</h3></div>\n        <div class=\"form-grid\">\n          <div class=\"form-field\">\n            <label>Nome do Quadro <span class=\"required\">*</span></label>\n            <input type=\"text\" [(ngModel)]=\"groupTitle\" name=\"groupTitle\" placeholder=\"Ex: Quadro de Avisos, Ideias, Documentações...\" autofocus />\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-field\">\n            <label>Cor de Destaque</label>\n            <div class=\"color-presets-row\">\n              <button type=\"button\" *ngFor=\"let c of colorPresets\" class=\"color-swatch-btn\" [style.background]=\"c.value\" [class.selected]=\"groupColor === c.value\" [matTooltip]=\"c.label\" (click)=\"groupColor = c.value\">\n                <mat-icon *ngIf=\"groupColor === c.value\">check</mat-icon>\n              </button>\n              <input type=\"color\" [(ngModel)]=\"groupColor\" name=\"groupColor\" class=\"color-input-custom\" matTooltip=\"Cor personalizada\" />\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"modal-footer\">\n      <ng-container *ngIf=\"!confirmDeleteGroup()\">\n        <button *ngIf=\"editingGroup()\" class=\"delete-btn\" (click)=\"solicitarExclusaoGrupo()\" [disabled]=\"loadingExcluirGrupo\">\n          <mat-icon>delete</mat-icon><span>Excluir Quadro</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"cancel-btn\" (click)=\"fecharGrupoModal()\">Cancelar</button>\n        <button class=\"primary-btn\" (click)=\"salvarGrupo()\" [disabled]=\"loadingSalvarGrupo || !groupTitle.trim()\">\n          <mat-progress-spinner *ngIf=\"loadingSalvarGrupo\" mode=\"indeterminate\" diameter=\"16\" class=\"button-spinner\"></mat-progress-spinner>\n          <mat-icon *ngIf=\"!loadingSalvarGrupo\">save</mat-icon>\n          <span>{{ loadingSalvarGrupo ? 'Salvando...' : 'Salvar Quadro' }}</span>\n        </button>\n      </ng-container>\n\n      <div class=\"delete-confirm-box\" *ngIf=\"confirmDeleteGroup()\">\n        <div class=\"confirm-text\">\n          <mat-icon class=\"warn-icon\">warning</mat-icon>\n          <span>Excluir este quadro? As notas existentes serão mantidas como notas soltas no mural.</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"confirm-actions\">\n          <button class=\"cancel-btn\" (click)=\"cancelarExclusaoGrupo()\">Voltar</button>\n          <button class=\"danger-btn\" (click)=\"confirmarExclusaoGrupo()\" [disabled]=\"loadingExcluirGrupo\">\n            <mat-progress-spinner *ngIf=\"loadingExcluirGrupo\" mode=\"indeterminate\" diameter=\"16\" class=\"button-spinner\"></mat-progress-spinner>\n            <span>Confirmar Exclusão</span>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ══════════════ MODAL NOVO MURAL ══════════════ -->\n<div class=\"modal-overlay\" *ngIf=\"createBoardModalOpen()\" (mousedown)=\"fecharNovoMuralModal()\">\n  <div class=\"modal-card modal-sm\" (mousedown)=\"$event.stopPropagation()\">\n    <div class=\"modal-header\">\n      <div class=\"header-main\">\n        <div class=\"header-badge\" [style.background]=\"newBoardColor || '#f59e0b'\">\n          <mat-icon>dashboard_customize</mat-icon>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h2>Novo Mural</h2>\n          <p>Crie um novo espaço de notas, avisos e ideias.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"close-btn\" (click)=\"fecharNovoMuralModal()\"><mat-icon>close</mat-icon></button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"modal-body\">\n      <div class=\"form-card\">\n        <div class=\"card-section-header\"><mat-icon class=\"color-amber\">space_dashboard</mat-icon><h3>Dados do Mural</h3></div>\n        <div class=\"form-grid\">\n          <div class=\"form-field\">\n            <label>Nome do Mural <span class=\"required\">*</span></label>\n            <input type=\"text\" [(ngModel)]=\"newBoardName\" placeholder=\"Ex: Projetos Pessoais, Planejamento...\" autofocus />\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-field\">\n            <label>Descrição</label>\n            <textarea [(ngModel)]=\"newBoardDescription\" rows=\"2\" class=\"custom-textarea\" placeholder=\"Descrição opcional...\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-field\">\n            <label>Cor do Mural</label>\n            <div class=\"color-presets-row\">\n              <button type=\"button\" *ngFor=\"let c of colorPresets\" class=\"color-swatch-btn\" [style.background]=\"c.value\" [class.selected]=\"newBoardColor === c.value\" [matTooltip]=\"c.label\" (click)=\"newBoardColor = c.value\">\n                <mat-icon *ngIf=\"newBoardColor === c.value\">check</mat-icon>\n              </button>\n              <input type=\"color\" [(ngModel)]=\"newBoardColor\" class=\"color-input-custom\" matTooltip=\"Cor personalizada\" />\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"modal-footer\">\n      <button class=\"cancel-btn\" (click)=\"fecharNovoMuralModal()\">Cancelar</button>\n      <button class=\"primary-btn\" (click)=\"salvarNovoMural()\" [disabled]=\"loadingCriarMural || !newBoardName.trim()\">\n        <mat-progress-spinner *ngIf=\"loadingCriarMural\" mode=\"indeterminate\" diameter=\"16\" class=\"button-spinner\"></mat-progress-spinner>\n        <mat-icon *ngIf=\"!loadingCriarMural\">save</mat-icon>\n        <span>{{ loadingCriarMural ? 'Criando...' : 'Criar Mural' }}</span>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ══════════════ MODAL CONFIGURAR MURAL ══════════════ -->\n<div class=\"modal-overlay\" *ngIf=\"boardModalOpen()\" (mousedown)=\"fecharBoardModal()\">\n  <div class=\"modal-card modal-sm\" (mousedown)=\"$event.stopPropagation()\">\n    <div class=\"modal-header\">\n      <div class=\"header-main\">\n        <div class=\"header-badge edit-mode\" [style.background]=\"boardColor || '#f59e0b'\"><mat-icon>space_dashboard</mat-icon></div>\n        <div><h2>Configurar Mural</h2><p>Altere o nome, descrição, cor ou exclua o mural.</p></div>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"close-btn\" (click)=\"fecharBoardModal()\"><mat-icon>close</mat-icon></button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"modal-body\">\n      <div class=\"form-card\">\n        <div class=\"card-section-header\"><mat-icon class=\"color-amber\">tune</mat-icon><h3>Dados do Mural</h3></div>\n        <div class=\"form-grid\">\n          <div class=\"form-field\">\n            <label>Nome <span class=\"required\">*</span></label>\n            <input type=\"text\" [(ngModel)]=\"boardName\" placeholder=\"Ex: Mural de Avisos\" />\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-field\">\n            <label>Descrição</label>\n            <textarea [(ngModel)]=\"boardDescription\" rows=\"3\" class=\"custom-textarea\" placeholder=\"Descrição opcional...\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-field\">\n            <label>Cor de Destaque</label>\n            <div class=\"color-presets-row\">\n              <button type=\"button\" *ngFor=\"let c of colorPresets\" class=\"color-swatch-btn\" [style.background]=\"c.value\" [class.selected]=\"boardColor === c.value\" [matTooltip]=\"c.label\" (click)=\"boardColor = c.value\">\n                <mat-icon *ngIf=\"boardColor === c.value\">check</mat-icon>\n              </button>\n              <input type=\"color\" [(ngModel)]=\"boardColor\" class=\"color-input-custom\" matTooltip=\"Cor personalizada\" />\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"modal-footer\">\n      <ng-container *ngIf=\"!confirmDeleteBoard()\">\n        <button *ngIf=\"activeBoard()?.myRole === 'admin'\" class=\"delete-btn\" (click)=\"solicitarExclusaoMural()\" [disabled]=\"loadingExcluirMural\">\n          <mat-icon>delete_outline</mat-icon><span>Excluir Mural</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"cancel-btn\" (click)=\"fecharBoardModal()\">Cancelar</button>\n        <button class=\"primary-btn\" (click)=\"salvarMural()\" [disabled]=\"loadingSalvarMural || !boardName.trim()\">\n          <mat-progress-spinner *ngIf=\"loadingSalvarMural\" mode=\"indeterminate\" diameter=\"16\" class=\"button-spinner\"></mat-progress-spinner>\n          <mat-icon *ngIf=\"!loadingSalvarMural\">save</mat-icon>\n          <span>{{ loadingSalvarMural ? 'Salvando...' : 'Salvar Alterações' }}</span>\n        </button>\n      </ng-container>\n\n      <div class=\"delete-confirm-box\" *ngIf=\"confirmDeleteBoard()\">\n        <div class=\"confirm-text\">\n          <mat-icon class=\"warn-icon\">warning</mat-icon>\n          <span>Excluir este mural e todas as suas notas? Esta ação não poderá ser desfeita.</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"confirm-actions\">\n          <button class=\"cancel-btn\" (click)=\"cancelarExclusaoMural()\">Voltar</button>\n          <button class=\"danger-btn\" (click)=\"confirmarExclusaoMural()\" [disabled]=\"loadingExcluirMural\">\n            <mat-progress-spinner *ngIf=\"loadingExcluirMural\" mode=\"indeterminate\" diameter=\"16\" class=\"button-spinner\"></mat-progress-spinner>\n            <span>Confirmar Exclusão</span>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ══════════════ MODAL DE TIME & SSO (IDÊNTICO AO TAREFAS) ══════════════ -->\n<div class=\"team-modal-backdrop\" *ngIf=\"teamModalOpen()\" (mousedown)=\"fecharTimeModal()\">\n  <section class=\"team-modal\" (mousedown)=\"$event.stopPropagation()\">\n    <header>\n      <div>\n        <h2>{{ creatingTeam() ? 'Criar novo time' : 'Gerenciar time' }}</h2>\n        <p>Times têm murais e quadros compartilhados entre todos os membros vinculados ao SSO.</p>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"icon-btn\" (click)=\"fecharTimeModal()\"><mat-icon>close</mat-icon></button>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"team-selector\" *ngIf=\"!creatingTeam() && teams().length > 1\">\n      <button *ngFor=\"let team of teams()\" [class.active]=\"currentTeam()?.id === team.id\" (click)=\"trocarTimeNoModal(team.id)\">\n        <span [style.background]=\"team.color\"></span>{{ team.name }}\n      </button>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Modo Criar Novo Time -->\n    <form class=\"team-create-form\" *ngIf=\"creatingTeam()\" (ngSubmit)=\"saveTeam()\">\n      <label>\n        <span>Nome do time *</span>\n        <input [(ngModel)]=\"newTeamName\" name=\"teamName\" maxlength=\"80\" placeholder=\"Ex.: Produto, Marketing, Operações\" autofocus required>\n      </label>\n      <div class=\"team-description-field\">\n        <div class=\"description-header\">\n          <span>Descrição</span>\n          <app-ai-text-button [text]=\"newTeamDescription\" (textChange)=\"newTeamDescription = $event\" />\n        </div>\n        <app-markdown-editor [text]=\"newTeamDescription\" (textChange)=\"newTeamDescription = $event\" [maxLength]=\"1000\" placeholder=\"Objetivo deste time\" ariaLabel=\"Descrição do time\" />\n      </div>\n      <label>\n        <span>Cor</span>\n        <input [(ngModel)]=\"newTeamColor\" name=\"teamColor\" type=\"color\">\n      </label>\n      <div class=\"team-form-actions\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"cancel-btn\" (click)=\"creatingTeam.set(false)\" *ngIf=\"teams().length\">Voltar</button>\n        <button class=\"primary-btn\" type=\"submit\" [disabled]=\"!newTeamName.trim()\">Criar time</button>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n\n    <!-- Modo Gerenciar Time Existente -->\n    <div class=\"team-management\" *ngIf=\"!creatingTeam() && currentTeam() as team\">\n      <div class=\"team-summary\">\n        <span class=\"team-logo\" [style.background]=\"team.color\"><mat-icon>groups</mat-icon></span>\n        <div>\n          <h3>{{ team.name }}</h3>\n          <p>{{ kanbanService.teamMembers().length || team.memberCount }} membro{{ (kanbanService.teamMembers().length || team.memberCount) !== 1 ? 's' : '' }} · {{ team.myRole === 'admin' ? 'Você administra este time' : 'Você é membro' }}</p>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"danger-icon\" *ngIf=\"team.myRole === 'admin' && !confirmDeleteTeam()\" (click)=\"solicitarExclusaoTime()\" matTooltip=\"Excluir time\">\n          <mat-icon>delete_outline</mat-icon>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Confirmação in-app de exclusão de time -->\n      <div class=\"in-app-confirm-banner\" *ngIf=\"confirmDeleteTeam()\">\n        <div class=\"confirm-content\">\n          <mat-icon class=\"warn-icon\">warning</mat-icon>\n          <span>Excluir time <strong>{{ team.name }}</strong> e todos os seus recursos?</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"confirm-buttons\">\n          <button class=\"cancel-btn-sm\" (click)=\"cancelarExclusaoTime()\">Cancelar</button>\n          <button class=\"danger-btn-sm\" (click)=\"confirmarExclusaoTime()\">Confirmar Exclusão</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Convidar usuário SSO -->\n      <div class=\"invite-row\" *ngIf=\"team.myRole === 'admin'\">\n        <select [(ngModel)]=\"invitedUserId\">\n          <option value=\"\">Selecione uma pessoa (SSO) para convidar</option>\n          <option *ngFor=\"let user of inviteableUsers()\" [value]=\"user.id\">{{ user.name }} · {{ user.email }}</option>\n        </select>\n        <button class=\"primary-btn\" (click)=\"inviteMember()\" [disabled]=\"!invitedUserId\">\n          <mat-icon>person_add</mat-icon>Convidar\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Lista de membros -->\n      <div class=\"member-list\">\n        <h4>Membros</h4>\n        <div class=\"member-row\" *ng