ent, WeekViewComponent, DayViewComponent,\r\n    MiniCalendarComponent, ThemeToggleComponent, CalendarManagerComponent, KanbanBoardComponent, MuralBoardComponent, NotificationSettingsComponent, AiAssistantComponent, LivroAbrindoComponent,\n  ],\r\n  templateUrl: './calendar-page.component.html',\r\n  styleUrl: './calendar-page.component.scss',\r\n})\r\nexport class CalendarPageComponent implements OnInit, OnDestroy {\r\n  @ViewChild(KanbanBoardComponent) private kanbanBoard?: KanbanBoardComponent;\n  @ViewChild(MuralBoardComponent) private muralBoard?: MuralBoardComponent;\r\n  private dialog = inject(MatDialog);\r\n  private eventsService = inject(EventsService);\r\n  private holidaysService = inject(HolidaysService);\r\n  public authService = inject(AuthService);\r\n  public calendarsService = inject(CalendarsService);\r\n  public syncService = inject(SyncService);\r\n  public invitationsService = inject(InvitationsService);\r\n  public kanbanService = inject(KanbanService);\n  public muralService = inject(MuralService);\n  public aiService = inject(AiService);\n  private router = inject(Router);\r\n  private route = inject(ActivatedRoute);\n  private readonly queryState = toSignal(this.route.queryParamMap, { initialValue: this.route.snapshot.queryParamMap });\n  private openedEventId = '';\n  private readonly notificationLink = effect(() => {\n    const query = this.queryState();\n    const eventId = query.get('evento');\n    const calendarId = query.get('agenda');\n    const calendars = this.calendarsService.calendars();\n    const events = this.eventsService.events();\n    if (!eventId) { this.openedEventId = ''; return; }\n    untracked(() => {\n      if (calendarId && calendars.some(calendar => calendar.id === calendarId) &&\n          !this.calendarsService.visibleCalendarIds().has(calendarId)) this.selectOnlyCalendar(calendarId);\n      const event = events.find(item => item.id === eventId);\n      if (event && this.openedEventId !== event.id) this.openEditModal(event);\n    });\n  });\n  readonly themeService = inject(ThemeService);\r\n  private readonly userPreferences = inject(UserPreferencesService);\r\n  private readonly appLoading = inject(AppLoadingService);\r\n  private initializedUserId = '';\r\n  private readonly authInitialization = effect(() => {\r\n    const user = this.authService.currentUser();\r\n    if (!user?.id || user.id === this.initializedUserId) return;\r\n    this.initializedUserId = user.id;\r\n    this.eventsService.currentUserId.set(user.id);\n    this.appLoading.complete();\r\n    this.calendarsService.loadAll(() => {\r\n      const requestedId = this.route.snapshot.queryParamMap.get('agenda');\r\n      const id = requestedId && this.calendars().some(calendar => calendar.id === requestedId)\r\n        ? requestedId\r\n        : [...this.calendarsService.visibleCalendarIds()][0];\r\n      if (id) this.selectOnlyCalendar(id);\r\n      this.appLoading.complete();\r\n    });\r\n    this.invitationsService.load();\r\n    this.kanbanService.loadTeamInvitations();\n    this.muralService.loadBoards();\r\n  });\r\n\r\n  readonly defaultAvatar = DEFAULT_AVATAR;\n\n  openAiAssistant(): void { this.aiService.openAssistant(); }\n\r\n  // ── Estado ──\r\n  currentView: CalendarView = this.userPreferences.calendarView();\r\n  activeSection: 'calendar' | 'tasks' | 'mural' = 'calendar';\r\n  selectedDate = new Date();\r\n  holidays: Holiday[] = [];\r\n  private selectedDateVersion = signal(0);\r\n  private holidaysVersion = signal(0);\r\n\r\n  // ── Modal de agendas ──\r\n  showCalendarManager = false;\r\n  editingCalendar: Calendar | null = null;\r\n  calendarDeleteTarget: Calendar | null = null;\r\n  calendarDeleteLoading = false;\r\n  readonly calendarContextMenu = signal<{ calendar: Calendar; x: number; y: number } | null>(null);\r\n  readonly eventContextMenu = signal<{ event: CalendarEvent; x: number; y: number } | null>(null);\r\n  readonly dayContextMenu = signal<{ date: string; x: number; y: number } | null>(null);\r\n  readonly eventDeleteTarget = signal<CalendarEvent | null>(null);\r\n  readonly eventDeleteLoading = signal(false);\r\n  readonly collapsedSidebarSections = signal<Set<string>>(\r\n    new Set(this.userPreferences.collapsedSidebarSections())\r\n  );\r\n  readonly agendaPillsExpanded = signal(this.userPreferences.agendaPillsExpanded());\r\n  readonly notificationSettingsOpen = signal(false);\r\n\r\n  readonly events = this.eventsService.events;\r\n  /** Eventos exibidos, incluindo os pagamentos padrão da Minha Agenda. */\r\n  readonly displayedEvents = computed<CalendarEvent[]>(() => {\r\n    this.selectedDateVersion();\r\n    this.holidaysVersion();\r\n    const seen = new Set<string>();\r\n    return [...this.events(), ...this.getPaymentEvents()].filter(event => {\r\n      // Cópias só são unidas enquanto todos os dados visuais forem iguais.\r\n      // Qualquer edição em uma agenda (datas, título, horário, cor etc.) a torna independente na tela.\r\n      const dayTimes = Object.entries(event.dayTimes || {})\r\n        .sort(([a], [b]) => a.localeCompare(b))\r\n        .map(([day, times]) => `${day}:${times.startTime}-${times.endTime}`)\r\n        .join('|');\r\n      const state = [event.title, event.description, event.date, event.endDate || event.date,\r\n        event.startTime, event.endTime, event.color, event.category, event.allDay, dayTimes].join('~');\r\n      const key = `${event.copyGroupId || event.id}~${state}`;\r\n      if (seen.has(key)) return false;\r\n      seen.add(key);\r\n      return true;\r\n    });\r\n  });\r\n  readonly currentUser = this.authService.currentUser;\r\n  readonly calendars = this.calendarsService.calendars;\r\n  readonly isTaskCalendarSelected = computed(() => {\r\n    const visibleIds = this.calendarsService.visibleCalendarIds();\r\n    return this.calendars().some(calendar => visibleIds.has(calendar.id) && calendar.isTaskCalendar);\r\n  });\r\n  readonly syncStatus = this.syncService.status;\r\n  readonly lastSyncAt = this.syncService.lastSyncAt;\r\n\r\n  // ── Getters de exibição ──\r\n  get year() { return this.selectedDate.getFullYear(); }\r\n  get month() { return this.selectedDate.getMonth(); }\r\n\r\n  get periodLabel(): string {\r\n    const months = ['Janeiro','Fevereiro','Março','Abril','Maio','Junho',\r\n                    'Julho','Agosto','Setembro','Outubro','Novembro','Dezembro'];\r\n    const d = this.selectedDate;\r\n    if (this.currentView === 'month') return `${months[d.getMonth()]} ${d.getFullYear()}`;\r\n    if (this.currentView === 'week') {\r\n      const sun = new Date(d); sun.setDate(d.getDate() - d.getDay());\r\n      const sat = new Date(sun); sat.setDate(sun.getDate() + 6);\r\n      if (sun.getMonth() === sat.getMonth())\r\n        return `${sun.getDate()} – ${sat.getDate()} de ${months[sun.getMonth()]} ${sun.getFullYear()}`;\r\n      return `${sun.getDate()} ${months[sun.getMonth()]} – ${sat.getDate()} ${months[sat.getMonth()]} ${sat.getFullYear()}`;\r\n    }\r\n    return `${d.getDate()} de ${months[d.getMonth()]} de ${d.getFullYear()}`;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  get lastSyncLabel(): string {\r\n    const t = this.lastSyncAt();\r\n    if (!t) return '';\r\n    const diff = Math.round((Date.now() - t.getTime()) / 1000);\r\n    if (diff < 5) return 'agora';\r\n    if (diff < 60) return `há ${diff}s`;\r\n    return `há ${Math.round(diff / 60)}min`;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  ngOnInit(): void {\r\n    this.route.paramMap.subscribe(() => {\r\n      this.applyRouteState();\r\n      this.loadHolidays(this.selectedDate.getFullYear());\r\n    });\r\n    this.syncService.connect();\n    window.setTimeout(() => this.appLoading.complete(), 600);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  ngOnDestroy(): void {\r\n    this.syncService.disconnect();\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  // ── Agendas ──\r\n  openCreateCalendar(): void {\r\n    this.editingCalendar = null;\r\n    this.showCalendarManager = true;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  openEditCalendar(cal: Calendar): void {\r\n    if (cal.isTaskCalendar) return;\r\n    this.editingCalendar = cal;\r\n    this.showCalendarManager = true;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  closeCalendarManager(): void {\r\n    this.showCalendarManager = false;\r\n    this.editingCalendar = null;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  onCalendarSaved(): void {\r\n    const id = [...this.calendarsService.visibleCalendarIds()][0];\r\n    if (id) this.selectOnlyCalendar(id);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  toggleCalendarVisibility(calendarId: string): void {\r\n    this.selectOnlyCalendar(calendarId);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  selectOnlyCalendar(calendarId: string, ev?: Event): void {\r\n    if (ev) ev.stopPropagation();\r\n    this.calendarsService.selectOnly(calendarId);\r\n    // Descarrega as demais e carrega apenas a selecionada\r\n    this.eventsService.events.update(list => list.filter(e => e.calendarId === calendarId));\r\n    this.eventsService.loadFromCalendar(calendarId);\r\n    if (this.activeSection === 'calendar') {\r\n      void this.router.navigate([], {\r\n        relativeTo: this.route,\r\n        queryParams: { agenda: calendarId },\r\n        queryParamsHandling: 'merge',\r\n      });\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  selectAllCalendars(): void {\r\n    this.calendarsService.selectAll();\r\n    const id = [...this.calendarsService.visibleCalendarIds()][0];\r\n    if (id) this.selectOnlyCalendar(id);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  deselectAllCalendars(): void {\r\n    this.selectAllCalendars();\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  removeCalendar(cal: Calendar): void {\r\n    if (cal.isDefault || cal.isTaskCalendar) return;\r\n    this.calendarDeleteTarget = cal;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  cancelCalendarDelete(): void {\r\n    if (this.calendarDeleteLoading) return;\r\n    this.calendarDeleteTarget = null;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  confirmCalendarDelete(): void {\r\n    const calendar = this.calendarDeleteTarget;\r\n    if (!calendar) return;\r\n    this.calendarDeleteLoading = true;\r\n    this.calendarsService.remove(calendar.id, success => {\r\n      this.calendarDeleteLoading = false;\r\n      if (!success) return;\r\n      this.calendarDeleteTarget = null;\r\n      this.eventsService.unloadCalendar(calendar.id);\r\n      const nextId = [...this.calendarsService.visibleCalendarIds()][0];\r\n      if (nextId) this.selectOnlyCalendar(nextId);\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  openCalendarContextMenu(mouseEvent: MouseEvent, calendar: Calendar): void {\r\n    mouseEvent.preventDefault();\r\n    mouseEvent.stopPropagation();\r\n    this.eventContextMenu.set(null);\r\n    this.dayContextMenu.set(null);\r\n    this.calendarContextMenu.set({\r\n      calendar,\r\n      x: Math.max(8, Math.min(mouseEvent.clientX, window.innerWidth - 206)),\r\n      y: Math.max(8, Math.min(mouseEvent.clientY, window.innerHeight - 150)),\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  openEventContextMenu(payload: { event: CalendarEvent; mouseEvent: MouseEvent }): void {\r\n    const { event, mouseEvent } = payload;\r\n    mouseEvent.preventDefault();\r\n    mouseEvent.stopPropagation();\r\n    this.calendarContextMenu.set(null);\r\n    this.dayContextMenu.set(null);\r\n    this.eventContextMenu.set({\r\n      event,\r\n      x: Math.max(8, Math.min(mouseEvent.clientX, window.innerWidth - 218)),\r\n      y: Math.max(8, Math.min(mouseEvent.clientY, window.innerHeight - 112)),\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  closeCalendarContextMenus(): void {\r\n    this.calendarContextMenu.set(null);\r\n    this.eventContextMenu.set(null);\r\n    this.dayContextMenu.set(null);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  openDayContextMenu(payload: { date: string; mouseEvent: MouseEvent }): void {\r\n    const { date, mouseEvent } = payload;\r\n    mouseEvent.preventDefault();\r\n    mouseEvent.stopPropagation();\r\n    if (this.isTaskCalendarSelected()) {\r\n      this.closeCalendarContextMenus();\r\n      return;\r\n    }\r\n    this.calendarContextMenu.set(null);\r\n    this.eventContextMenu.set(null);\r\n    this.dayContextMenu.set({\r\n      date,\r\n      x: Math.max(8, Math.min(mouseEvent.clientX, window.innerWidth - 190)),\r\n      y: Math.max(8, Math.min(mouseEvent.clientY, window.innerHeight - 52)),\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  createEventFromContext(date: string): void {\r\n    this.closeCalendarContextMenus();\r\n    this.openCreateModal(date);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  selectCalendarFromContext(calendar: Calendar): void {\r\n    this.closeCalendarContextMenus();\r\n    this.selectOnlyCalendar(calendar.id);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  editCalendarFromContext(calendar: Calendar): void {\r\n    this.closeCalendarContextMenus();\r\n    if (this.calendarsService.canEdit(calendar.id)) this.openEditCalendar(calendar);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  deleteCalendarFromContext(calendar: Calendar): void {\r\n    this.closeCalendarContextMenus();\r\n    if (this.calendarsService.isOwner(calendar.id) && !calendar.isDefault) this.removeCalendar(calendar);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  viewEventFromContext(event: CalendarEvent): void {\n    this.closeCalendarContextMenus();\n    this.openViewModal(event);\n  }\n\n  editEventFromContext(event: CalendarEvent): void {\r\n    this.closeCalendarContextMenus();\r\n    if (this.canManageEvent(event)) this.openEditModal(event);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  requestEventDeletion(event: CalendarEvent): void {\r\n    this.closeCalendarContextMenus();\r\n    if (this.canManageEvent(event)) this.eventDeleteTarget.set(event);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  cancelEventDeletion(): void {\r\n    if (this.eventDeleteLoading()) return;\r\n    this.eventDeleteTarget.set(null);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  confirmEventDeletion(): void {\r\n    const event = this.eventDeleteTarget();\r\n    if (!event || !this.canManageEvent(event)) return;\r\n    this.eventDeleteLoading.set(true);\r\n    this.eventsService.remove(event.id, success => {\r\n      this.eventDeleteLoading.set(false);\r\n      if (success) this.eventDeleteTarget.set(null);\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  canManageEvent(event: CalendarEvent): boolean {\r\n    return !event.isSystem && !event.isTaskDeadline && this.calendarsService.canEdit(event.calendarId);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  myCalendars(): Calendar[] {\r\n    const uid = this.currentUser()?.id;\r\n    return this.calendars().filter(c => c.owner_id === uid && !c.isTaskCalendar);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  sharedCalendars(): Calendar[] {\r\n    const uid = this.currentUser()?.id;\r\n    return this.calendars().filter(c => c.owner_id !== uid && !c.isTaskCalendar);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  taskCalendars(): Calendar[] {\r\n    return this.calendars().filter(calendar => calendar.isTaskCalendar);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  calendarDisplayName(calendar: Calendar): string {\r\n    return calendar.isTaskCalendar && calendar.taskTeamName\r\n      ? `${calendar.taskTeamName} · Tarefas`\r\n      : calendar.name;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  isSidebarSectionCollapsed(sectionId: string): boolean {\r\n    return this.collapsedSidebarSections().has(sectionId);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  toggleSidebarSection(sectionId: string): void {\r\n    this.collapsedSidebarSections.update(current => {\r\n      const next = new Set(current);\r\n      next.has(sectionId) ? next.delete(sectionId) : next.add(sectionId);\r\n      this.userPreferences.setCollapsedSidebarSections(next);\r\n      return next;\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  toggleAgendaPills(): void {\r\n    this.agendaPillsExpanded.update(expanded => {\r\n      const next = !expanded;\r\n      this.userPreferences.setAgendaPillsExpanded(next);\r\n      return next;\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  // ── Navegação ──\r\n  goToday(): void {\r\n    this.selectedDate = new Date();\r\n    this.selectedDateVersion.update(value => value + 1);\r\n    this.loadHolidays(this.selectedDate.getFullYear());\r\n    this.navigateToCalendar();\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  navigate(dir: -1 | 1): void {\r\n    const d = new Date(this.selectedDate);\r\n    if (this.currentView === 'month') d.setMonth(d.getMonth() + dir);\r\n    else if (this.currentView === 'week') d.setDate(d.getDate() + dir * 7);\r\n    else d.setDate(d.getDate() + dir);\r\n    this.selectedDate = d;\r\n    this.selectedDateVersion.update(value => value + 1);\r\n    this.loadHolidays(d.getFullYear());\r\n    this.navigateToCalendar();\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  setView(view: CalendarView): void {\r\n    this.currentView = view;\r\n    this.userPreferences.setCalendarView(view);\r\n    this.navigateToCalendar();\r\n  }\r\n  setSection(section: 'calendar' | 'tasks' | 'mural'): void {\n    if (section === 'tasks') {\n      const boardId = this.kanbanService.activeBoard()?.id;\n      void this.router.navigate(boardId ? ['/tarefas', boardId] : ['/tarefas']);\n      return;\n    }\n    if (section === 'mural') {\n      const boardId = this.muralService.activeBoard()?.id;\n      void this.router.navigate(boardId ? ['/mural', boardId] : ['/mural']);\n      return;\n    }\n    this.navigateToCalendar();\n  }\n  openMuralCreate(): void {\n    const boardId = this.muralService.activeBoard()?.id;\n    void this.router.navigate(boardId ? ['/mural', boardId] : ['/mural']);\n    setTimeout(() => this.muralBoard?.abrirNovoItem());\n  }\n  _oldSetSection(section: any): void {\r\n    if (section === 'tasks') {\r\n      const boardId = this.kanbanService.activeBoard()?.id;\r\n      void this.router.navigate(boardId ? ['/tarefas', boardId] : ['/tarefas']);\r\n      return;\r\n    }\r\n    this.navigateToCalendar();\r\n  }\r\n  openTaskCreate(): void {\r\n    const boardId = this.kanbanService.activeBoard()?.id;\r\n    void this.router.navigate(boardId ? ['/tarefas', boardId] : ['/tarefas'], { queryParams: { acao: 'nova-tarefa' } });\r\n    setTimeout(() => this.kanbanBoard?.openCreate());\r\n  }\r\n  onMiniCalDateSelected(date: Date): void { this.selectedDate = date; this.selectedDateVersion.update(value => value + 1); this.loadHolidays(date.getFullYear()); this.navigateToCalendar(); }\r\n  onMiniCalMonthChanged(date: Date): void { this.loadHolidays(date.getFullYear()); }\r\n\r\n  // ── Modal de eventos ──\r\n  openCreateModal(defaultDate?: string): void {\r\n    if (this.isTaskCalendarSelected()) return;\r\n    const targetCalendarIds = this.calendarsService.calendars()\r\n      .filter(cal => this.calendarsService.visibleCalendarIds().has(cal.id) && this.calendarsService.canEdit(cal.id))\r\n      .map(cal => cal.id);\r\n    void this.router.navigate([], {\r\n      relativeTo: this.route,\r\n      queryParams: { acao: 'novo-evento', data: defaultDate || this.toDatePath(this.selectedDate), evento: null },\r\n      queryParamsHandling: 'merge',\r\n    });\r\n    const dialogRef = this.dialog.open(EventModalComponent, {\r\n      width: '600px', maxWidth: '98vw',\r\n      data: { defaultDate, targetCalendarIds } satisfies EventModalData,\r\n      panelClass: 'agenda-dialog',\r\n      disableClose: true,\r\n    });\r\n    dialogRef.afterClosed().subscribe(() => this.clearUrlAction());\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  openViewModal(event: CalendarEvent): void {\n    if (event.isTaskDeadline) {\n      this.openTaskFromCalendar(event);\n      return;\n    }\n    if (this.openedEventId === event.id && this.dialog.openDialogs.length) return;\n    this.openedEventId = event.id;\n    void this.router.navigate([], {\n      relativeTo: this.route,\n      queryParams: { evento: event.id, acao: null, data: null },\n      queryParamsHandling: 'merge',\n    });\n    const dialogRef = this.dialog.open(EventModalComponent, {\n      width: '600px', maxWidth: '98vw',\n      data: { event, readOnly: true } satisfies EventModalData,\n      panelClass: 'agenda-dialog',\n      disableClose: true,\n    });\n    dialogRef.afterClosed().subscribe(() => this.clearUrlAction());\n  }\n\n  openEditModal(event: CalendarEvent): void {\n    if (event.isTaskDeadline) {\r\n      this.openTaskFromCalendar(event);\r\n      return;\r\n    }\r\n    if (event.isSystem) return;\n    if (this.openedEventId === event.id && this.dialog.openDialogs.length) return;\n    this.openedEventId = event.id;\n    void this.router.navigate([], {\r\n      relativeTo: this.route,\r\n      queryParams: { evento: event.id, acao: null, data: null },\r\n      queryParamsHandling: 'merge',\r\n    });\r\n    const dialogRef = this.dialog.open(EventModalComponent, {\r\n      width: '600px', maxWidth: '98vw',\r\n      data: { event, readOnly: !this.calendarsService.canEdit(event.calendarId) } satisfies EventModalData,\r\n      panelClass: 'agenda-dialog',\r\n      disableClose: true,\r\n    });\r\n    dialogRef.afterClosed().subscribe(() => this.clearUrlAction());\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  private openTaskFromCalendar(event: CalendarEvent): void {\r\n    if (!event.taskId || !event.taskBoardId) return;\r\n    void this.router.navigate(['/tarefas', event.taskBoardId], {\r\n      queryParams: {\r\n        tarefa: event.taskId,\r\n        ramificacao: event.taskParentId || null,\r\n      },\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  onEventDrop(payload: { eventId: string; oldDate: string; oldEndDate?: string; newDate: string; newStartTime?: string; newEndTime?: string }): void {\r\n    if (payload.eventId.startsWith('system-payment-') || this.events().find(event => event.id === payload.eventId)?.isSystem) return;\r\n    // Calcula o delta em dias entre a data original e a nova data\r\n    const oldMs = new Date(payload.oldDate + 'T00:00:00Z').getTime();\r\n    const newMs = new Date(payload.newDate + 'T00:00:00Z').getTime();\r\n    const deltaDays = Math.round((newMs - oldMs) / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24));\r\n\r\n    // Aplica o mesmo deslocamento ao endDate para preservar a duração do evento\r\n    const oldEnd = payload.oldEndDate || payload.oldDate;\r\n    const endMs = new Date(oldEnd + 'T00:00:00').getTime() + deltaDays * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000;\r\n    const newEndDate = new Date(endMs).toISOString().slice(0, 10);\r\n\r\n    const changes: Record<string, string> = {\r\n      date: payload.newDate,\r\n      endDate: newEndDate,\r\n    };\r\n    if (payload.newStartTime) changes['startTime'] = payload.newStartTime;\r\n    if (payload.newEndTime) changes['endTime'] = payload.newEndTime;\r\n\r\n    this.eventsService.update(payload.eventId, changes);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  logout(): void {\r\n    this.authService.logout();\r\n    this.router.navigate(['/unauthorized']);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  respondToInvitation(invitation: CalendarInvitation, accept: boolean): void {\r\n    this.invitationsService.respond(invitation, accept, () => {\r\n      if (accept) this.calendarsService.loadAll();\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  private loadHolidays(year: number): void {\r\n    this.holidaysService.getHolidays(year).subscribe({\r\n      next: h => { this.holidays = h; this.holidaysVersion.update(value => value + 1); },\r\n      error: () => { this.holidays = []; this.holidaysVersion.update(value => value + 1); },\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  private applyRouteState(): void {\r\n    const path = this.router.url.split('?')[0];\r\n    if (path.startsWith('/tarefas')) {\r\n      this.activeSection = 'tasks';\r\n      return;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    if (path.startsWith('/mural')) {\n      this.activeSection = 'mural';\n      return;\n    }\n\n    this.activeSection = 'calendar';\r\n    const viewParam = this.route.snapshot.paramMap.get('view');\r\n    const views: Record<string, CalendarView> = { mes: 'month', semana: 'week', dia: 'day' };\r\n    if (viewParam && views[viewParam]) {\r\n      this.currentView = views[viewParam];\r\n      this.userPreferences.setCalendarView(this.currentView);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    const dateParam = this.route.snapshot.paramMap.get('date');\r\n    if (dateParam && /^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$/.test(dateParam)) {\r\n      const [year, month, day] = dateParam.split('-').map(Number);\r\n      const parsed = new Date(year, month - 1, day);\r\n      if (!Number.isNaN(parsed.getTime()) && this.toDatePath(parsed) !== this.toDatePath(this.selectedDate)) {\r\n        this.selectedDate = parsed;\r\n        this.selectedDateVersion.update(value => value + 1);\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    if (!viewParam || !dateParam) this.navigateToCalendar(true);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  private navigateToCalendar(replaceUrl = false): void {\r\n    this.activeSection = 'calendar';\r\n    const viewSlug: Record<CalendarView, string> = { month: 'mes', week: 'semana', day: 'dia' };\r\n    const agendaId = this.route.snapshot.queryParamMap.get('agenda')\r\n      || [...this.calendarsService.visibleCalendarIds()][0];\r\n    void this.router.navigate(['/calendario', viewSlug[this.currentView], this.toDatePath(this.selectedDate)], {\r\n      replaceUrl,\r\n      queryParams: agendaId ? { agenda: agendaId } : undefined,\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  private clearUrlAction(): void {\r\n    void this.router.navigate([], {\r\n      relativeTo: this.route,\r\n      replaceUrl: true,\r\n      queryParams: { acao: null, data: null, evento: null },\r\n      queryParamsHandling: 'merge',\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  private toDatePath(date: Date): string {\r\n    return `${date.getFullYear()}-${String(date.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, '0')}-${String(date.getDate()).padStart(2, '0')}`;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  private getPaymentEvents(): CalendarEvent[] {\r\n    const currentUserId = this.currentUser()?.id;\r\n    const defaultCalendar = this.calendars().find(calendar =>\r\n      calendar.owner_id === currentUserId && calendar.isDefault &&\r\n      this.calendarsService.visibleCalendarIds().has(calendar.id)\r\n    );\r\n    if (!defaultCalendar) return [];\r\n\r\n    const year = this.selectedDate.getFullYear();\r\n    const holidayDates = new Set(this.holidays.map(holiday => holiday.date));\r\n    const toDateString = (date: Date) => `${date.getFullYear()}-${String(date.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, '0')}-${String(date.getDate()).padStart(2, '0')}`;\r\n    const isHoliday = (date: Date) => holidayDates.has(toDateString(date));\r\n    const isBankingDay = (date: Date) => date.getDay() !== 0 && date.getDay() !== 6 && !isHoliday(date);\n    const isWorkdayForCount = (date: Date) => date.getDay() !== 0 && !isHoliday(date);\n    const fifthBusinessDay = (month: number) => {\n      let businessDays = 0;\n      let targetDate = new Date(year, month, 1);\n      for (let day = 1; ; day++) {\n        const date = new Date(year, month, day);\n        if (isWorkdayForCount(date)) {\n          businessDays++;\n          if (businessDays === 5) {\n            targetDate = date;\n            break;\n          }\n        }\n      }\n      while (!isBankingDay(targetDate)) {\n        targetDate.setDate(targetDate.getDate() - 1);\n      }\n      return targetDate;\n    };\n    const salaryAdvanceDay = (month: number) => {\n      const date = new Date(year, month, 20);\n      while (!isBankingDay(date)) {\n        date.setDate(date.getDate() - 1);\n      }\n      return date;\n    };\n\n    return Array.from({ length: 12 }, (_, month) => [\r\n      { id: `system-payment-fifth-${year}-${month}`, date: fifthBusinessDay(month), title: 'Pagamento, vale alimentação e transporte' },\r\n      { id: `system-payment-advance-${year}-${month}`, date: salaryAdvanceDay(month), title: 'Adiantamento salarial e vale transporte' },\r\n    ]).flat().map(item => {\r\n      const date = toDateString(item.date);\r\n      return {\r\n        id: item.id,\r\n        calendarId: defaultCalendar.id,\r\n        title: item.title,\r\n        description: 'Evento padrão de pagamento.',\r\n        date,\r\n        endDate: date,\r\n        startTime: '00:00',\r\n        endTime: '23:59',\r\n        color: 'emerald' as const,\r\n        category: 'Financeiro',\r\n        allDay: true,\r\n        isSystem: true,\r\n        attachments: [],\r\n      };\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n","<!-- ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\r\n     ║  SKILL: Angular Page Groups Layout                      ║\r\n     ║  GRUPO 1 — Header/Ações | GRUPO 2 — Conteúdo principal ║\r\n     ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝ -->\r\n\r\n<div class=\"page-layout\" (click)=\"closeCalendarContextMenus()\">\r\n\r\n  <!-- ══════════════ SIDEBAR ══════════════ -->\r\n  <aside class=\"sidebar\">\r\n    <div class=\"sidebar-top\">\r\n      <!-- Logo -->\r\n      <div class=\"app-brand\">\r\n        <div class=\"app-brand-icon\" [class.realm-angel]=\"themeService.realm() === 'angel'\"\r\n          [class.realm-demon]=\"themeService.realm() === 'demon'\" [class.realm-cadu]=\"themeService.realm() === 'cadu'\"\r\n          (click)=\"themeService.cycleRealm()\"\r\n          [title]=\"themeService.realm() === 'angel' ? '😇 Modo Angelical ativo — clique para Modo Demoníaco' : themeService.realm() === 'demon' ? '😈 Modo Demoníaco ativo — clique para Modo Cadu Maverick' : themeService.realm() === 'cadu' ? '🏄‍♂️ Modo Cadu Maverick ativo — clique para sair' : '✨ Clique para alternar reinos épicos'\"\r\n          style=\"cursor: pointer;\">\r\n          <img src=\"sidebar.png\" alt=\"Sidebar Logo\"\r\n            style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; background: transparent;\">\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div>\r\n          <div class=\"app-brand-name\">Agenda</div>\r\n          <div class=\"app-brand-sub\">Corporativa</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <nav class=\"app-section-tabs\" aria-label=\"Módulos do sistema\" [attr.data-active]=\"activeSection\">\r\n        <!-- Linha superior fixa: Agenda -->\r\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-top-btn\" [class.active]=\"activeSection === 'calendar'\"\r\n          (click)=\"setSection('calendar')\" id=\"nav-btn-agenda\">\r\n          <mat-icon>calendar_month</mat-icon>\r\n          <span>Agenda</span>\r\n        </button>\r\n        <!-- Linha inferior fixa: Tarefas e Mural lado a lado -->\r\n        <div class=\"tab-bottom-row\">\r\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-bottom-btn\" [class.active]=\"activeSection === 'tasks'\"\r\n            (click)=\"setSection('tasks')\" id=\"nav-btn-tasks\">\r\n            <mat-icon>view_kanban</mat-icon>\r\n            <span>Tarefas</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-bottom-btn\" [class.active]=\"activeSection === 'mural'\"\r\n            (click)=\"setSection('mural')\" id=\"nav-btn-mural\">\r\n            <mat-icon>space_dashboard</mat-icon>\r\n            <span>Mural</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </nav>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Botão criar evento -->\r\n      <button *ngIf=\"activeSection === 'calendar'\" class=\"btn-create\" [disabled]=\"isTaskCalendarSelected()\"\r\n        (click)=\"openCreateModal()\" id=\"btn-create-event\"\r\n        [matTooltip]=\"isTaskCalendarSelected() ? 'Os eventos desta agenda são gerenciados pelos cards de tarefas' : 'Criar novo evento'\">\r\n        <span class=\"btn-create-icon\">＋</span>\r\n        <span>{{ isTaskCalendarSelected() ? 'Gerenciada por Tarefas' : 'Criar evento' }}</span>\r\n      </button>\r\n      <button *ngIf=\"activeSection === 'tasks'\" class=\"btn-create\" (click)=\"openTaskCreate()\" id=\"btn-create-task\"\r\n        matTooltip=\"Criar nova tarefa\">\r\n        <span class=\"btn-create-icon\">＋</span>\r\n        <span>Criar tarefa</span>\r\n      </button>\r\n      <button *ngIf=\"activeSection === 'mural'\" class=\"btn-create\" (click)=\"openMuralCreate()\" id=\"btn-create-mural\"\r\n        matTooltip=\"Criar novo cartão no mural\">\r\n        <span class=\"btn-create-icon\">＋</span>\r\n        <span>Criar cartão</span>\r\n      </button>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Conteúdo central rolável -->\r\n    <div class=\"sidebar-content\" [hidden]=\"activeSection !== 'calendar'\">\r\n      <!-- Mini calendário -->\r\n      <app-mini-calendar [selectedDate]=\"selectedDate\" [holidays]=\"holidays\" [events]=\"displayedEvents()\"\r\n        (dateSelected)=\"onMiniCalDateSelected($event)\"\r\n        (monthChanged)=\"onMiniCalMonthChanged($event)\"></app-mini-calendar>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"sidebar-divider\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- ── Minhas Agendas ── -->\r\n      <div class=\"sidebar-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"sidebar-section-header\">\r\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"sidebar-section-toggle\" (click)=\"toggleSidebarSection('my-calendars')\"\r\n            [attr.aria-expanded]=\"!isSidebarSectionCollapsed('my-calendars')\" aria-controls=\"my-calendars-list\">\r\n            <mat-icon>{{ isSidebarSectionCollapsed('my-calendars') ? 'chevron_right' : 'expand_more' }}</mat-icon>\r\n            <span class=\"sidebar-section-title\">Minhas Agendas</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"sidebar-section-actions\">\r\n            <button class=\"btn-add-calendar\" (click)=\"openCreateCalendar()\" matTooltip=\"Nova agenda\"\r\n              id=\"btn-new-calendar\">\r\n              <mat-icon>add</mat-icon>\r\n            </button>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"calendar-list\" id=\"my-calendars-list\" *ngIf=\"!isSidebarSectionCollapsed('my-calendars')\">\r\n          <div *ngFor=\"let cal of myCalendars()\" class=\"calendar-item\" [style.--cal-color]=\"cal.color\"\r\n            [class.is-active]=\"calendarsService.visibleCalendarIds().has(cal.id)\"\r\n            [class.is-solo]=\"calendarsService.isOnlySelected(cal.id)\" (click)=\"toggleCalendarVisibility(cal.id)\"\r\n            (contextmenu)=\"openCalendarContextMenu($event, cal)\">\r\n            <div class=\"calendar-info\">\r\n              <span class=\"calendar-name\" [matTooltip]=\"cal.name\">{{ cal.name }}</span>\r\n              <span *ngIf=\"cal.isPrivate\" class=\"lock-icon\" matTooltip=\"Privada\">\r\n                <mat-icon>lock</mat-icon>\r\n              </span>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"calendar-actions\" (click)=\"$event.stopPropagation()\">\r\n              <button class=\"btn-cal-menu solo-btn\" (click)=\"selectOnlyCalendar(cal.id, $event)\"\r\n                matTooltip=\"Ver apenas esta agenda\">\r\n                <mat-icon>filter_center_focus</mat-icon>\r\n              </button>\r\n              <button class=\"btn-cal-menu\" (click)=\"openEditCalendar(cal)\" matTooltip=\"Editar agenda\">\r\n                <mat-icon>edit</mat-icon>\r\n              </button>\r\n              <button *ngIf=\"!cal.isDefault\" class=\"btn-cal-menu danger\" (click)=\"removeCalendar(cal)\"\r\n                matTooltip=\"Excluir agenda\">\r\n                <mat-icon>delete_outline</mat-icon>\r\n              </button>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n          <div *ngIf=\"myCalendars().length === 0\" class=\"no-calendars-hint\">\r\n            <mat-icon>calendar_today</mat-icon>\r\n            <span>Nenhuma agenda criada</span>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- ── Agendas Compartilhadas ── -->\r\n      <div class=\"sidebar-section\" *ngIf=\"sharedCalendars().length > 0\">\r\n        <div class=\"sidebar-section-header\">\r\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"sidebar-section-toggle\" (click)=\"toggleSidebarSection('shared-calendars')\"\r\n            [attr.aria-expanded]=\"!isSidebarSectionCollapsed('shared-calendars')\" aria-controls=\"shared-calendars-list\">\r\n            <mat-icon>{{ isSidebarSectionCollapsed('shared-calendars') ? 'chevron_right' : 'expand_more' }}</mat-icon>\r\n            <span class=\"sidebar-section-title\">Compartilhadas</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"calendar-list\" id=\"shared-calendars-list\" *ngIf=\"!isSidebarSectionCollapsed('shared-calendars')\">\r\n          <div *ngFor=\"let cal of sharedCalendars()\" class=\"calendar-item\" [style.--cal-color]=\"cal.color\"\r\n            [class.is-active]=\"calendarsService.visibleCalendarIds().has(cal.id)\"\r\n            [class.is-solo]=\"calendarsService.isOnlySelected(cal.id)\" (click)=\"toggleCalendarVisibility(cal.id)\"\r\n            (contextmenu)=\"openCalendarContextMenu($event, cal)\">\r\n            <div class=\"calendar-info\">\r\n              <span class=\"calendar-name\" [matTooltip]=\"cal.name\">{{ cal.name }}</span>\r\n              <span class=\"shared-badge\" matTooltip=\"Compartilhada\">\r\n                <mat-icon>group</mat-icon>\r\n              </span>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"calendar-actions\" (click)=\"$event.stopPropagation()\">\r\n              <button class=\"btn-cal-menu solo-btn\" (click)=\"selectOnlyCalendar(cal.id, $event)\"\r\n                matTooltip=\"Ver apenas esta agenda\">\r\n                <mat-icon>filter_center_focus</mat-icon>\r\n              </button>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Agendas automáticas de todos os times de tarefas -->\r\n      <div class=\"sidebar-section task-calendars-section\" *ngIf=\"taskCalendars().length > 0\">\r\n        <div class=\"sidebar-section-header\">\r\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"sidebar-section-toggle\" (click)=\"toggleSidebarSection('task-calendars')\"\r\n            [attr.aria-expanded]=\"!isSidebarSectionCollapsed('task-calendars')\" aria-controls=\"task-calendars-list\">\r\n            <mat-icon>{{ isSidebarSectionCollapsed('task-calendars') ? 'chevron_right' : 'expand_more' }}</mat-icon>\r\n            <span class=\"sidebar-section-title\">Tarefas</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"calendar-list\" id=\"task-calendars-list\" *ngIf=\"!isSidebarSectionCollapsed('task-calendars')\">\r\n          <div *ngFor=\"let cal of taskCalendars()\" class=\"calendar-item task-calendar-item\"\r\n            [style.--cal-color]=\"cal.color\" [class.is-active]=\"calendarsService.visibleCalendarIds().has(cal.id)\"\r\n            [class.is-solo]=\"calendarsService.isOnlySelected(cal.id)\" (click)=\"toggleCalendarVisibility(cal.id)\">\r\n            <div class=\"calendar-info\">\r\n              <span class=\"calendar-name\"\r\n                [matTooltip]=\"cal.taskTeamName ? 'Agenda automática do time ' + cal.taskTeamName : 'Agenda automática de tarefas'\">{{\r\n                cal.taskTeamName || 'Agenda de tarefas' }}</span>\r\n              <span class=\"task-calendar-badge\" matTooltip=\"Esta agenda só é excluída junto com o time\">\r\n                <mat-icon>lock</mat-icon>\r\n              </span>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"calendar-actions\" (click)=\"$event.stopPropagation()\">\r\n              <button class=\"btn-cal-menu solo-btn\" (click)=\"selectOnlyCalendar(cal.id, $event)\"\r\n                matTooltip=\"Ver apenas esta agenda\">\r\n                <mat-icon>filter_center_focus</mat-icon>\r\n              </button>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sidebar-content tasks-sidebar\" [hidden]=\"activeSection !== 'tasks'\">\r\n      <div class=\"tasks-sidebar-hero\">\r\n        <span class=\"tasks-sidebar-icon\"><mat-icon>task_alt</mat-icon></span>\r\n        <h2>Central de tarefas</h2>\r\n        <p>Planeje, priorize e mova seus cartões por cada etapa do trabalho.</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div class=\"sidebar-divider\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"sidebar-section task-tips\">\r\n        <div class=\"sidebar-section-header\">\r\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"sidebar-section-toggle\" (click)=\"toggleSidebarSection('task-tips')\"\r\n            [attr.aria-expanded]=\"!isSidebarSectionCollapsed('task-tips')\" aria-controls=\"task-tips-list\">\r\n            <mat-icon>{{ isSidebarSectionCollapsed('task-tips') ? 'chevron_right' : 'expand_more' }}</mat-icon>\r\n            <span class=\"sidebar-section-title\">Como usar</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div id=\"task-tips-list\" class=\"task-tips-list\" *ngIf=\"!isSidebarSectionCollapsed('task-tips')\">\r\n          <div><mat-icon>drag_indicator</mat-icon><span>Arraste cartões entre as listas</span></div>\r\n          <div><mat-icon>edit_note</mat-icon><span>Clique para editar os detalhes</span></div>\r\n          <div><mat-icon>checklist</mat-icon><span>Acompanhe checklists e prazos</span></div>\r\n          <div><mat-icon>archive</mat-icon><span>Arquive sem perder o histórico</span></div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ══════════════ MURAL SIDEBAR ══════════════ -->\r\n    <div class=\"sidebar-content tasks-sidebar mural-sidebar\" [hidden]=\"activeSection !== 'mural'\">\r\n      <div class=\"tasks-sidebar-hero mural-sidebar-hero\">\r\n        <span class=\"tasks-sidebar-icon mural-sidebar-icon\"><mat-icon>space_dashboard</mat-icon></span>\r\n        <h2>Mural Corporativo</h2>\r\n        <p>Fixe comunicados, notas, fotos e documentos em murais interativos.</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"sidebar-divider\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Seus Murais -->\r\n      <div class=\"sidebar-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"sidebar-section-header\">\r\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"sidebar-section-toggle\" (click)=\"toggleSidebarSection('mural-boards')\"\r\n            [attr.aria-expanded]=\"!isSidebarSectionCollapsed('mural-boards')\" aria-controls=\"mural-boards-list\">\r\n            <mat-icon>{{ isSidebarSectionCollapsed('mural-boards') ? 'chevron_right' : 'expand_more' }}</mat-icon>\r\n            <span class=\"sidebar-section-title\">Seus Murais</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div id=\"mural-boards-list\" class=\"calendar-list\" *ngIf=\"!isSidebarSectionCollapsed('mural-boards')\">\r\n          <div *ngFor=\"let b of muralService.boards()\" class=\"calendar-item\"\r\n            [class.is-active]=\"muralService.activeBoard()?.id === b.id\" [style.--cal-color]=\"b.color\"\r\n            (click)=\"muralService.loadBoard(b.id)\">\r\n            <div class=\"calendar-info\">\r\n              <span class=\"calendar-dot\" [style.background]=\"b.color\"></span>\r\n              <span class=\"calendar-name\">{{ b.name }}</span>\r\n              <span class=\"mural-count-badge\" *ngIf=\"b.itemCount\">{{ b.itemCount }}</span>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"sidebar-divider\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Como Usar o Mural -->\r\n      <div class=\"sidebar-section task-tips\">\r\n        <div class=\"sidebar-section-header\">\r\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"sidebar-section-toggle\" (click)=\"toggleSidebarSection('mural-tips')\"\r\n            [attr.aria-expanded]=\"!isSidebarSectionCollapsed('mural-tips')\" aria-controls=\"mural-tips-list\">\r\n            <mat-icon>{{ isSidebarSectionCollapsed('mural-tips') ? 'chevron_right' : 'expand_more' }}</mat-icon>\r\n            <span class=\"sidebar-section-title\">Como usar o Mural</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div id=\"mural-tips-list\" class=\"task-tips-list\" *ngIf=\"!isSidebarSectionCollapsed('mural-tips')\">\r\n          <div><mat-icon>push_pin</mat-icon><span>Fixe comunicados em destaque</span></div>\r\n          <div><mat-icon>create_new_folder</mat-icon><span>Agrupe cartões por categorias</span></div>\r\n          <div><mat-icon>attach_file</mat-icon><span>Anexe múltiplos PDFs e fotos</span></div>\r\n          <div><mat-icon>checklist</mat-icon><span>Checklists elegantes em Markdown</span></div>\r\n          <div><mat-icon>drag_indicator</mat-icon><span>Arraste notas entre grupos</span></div>\r\n          <div><mat-icon>group_add</mat-icon><span>Compartilhe murais com times SSO</span></div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Rodapé fixo no canto inferior esquerdo -->\r\n    <div class=\"sidebar-footer\">\r\n      <!-- Perfil do Usuário -->\r\n      <div class=\"sidebar-user-card\" *ngIf=\"currentUser() as user\">\r\n        <div class=\"user-avatar has-img\">\r\n          <img [src]=\"user.avatar || defaultAvatar\" [alt]=\"user.name\"\r\n            (error)=\"$any($event.target).src = defaultAvatar\" />\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"user-info\">\r\n          <span class=\"user-name\" [matTooltip]=\"user.name\">{{ user.name }}</span>\r\n          <span class=\"user-dept\">{{ user.departamentName || 'Corporativo' }}</span>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <button class=\"btn-logout btn-notifications\" (click)=\"notificationSettingsOpen.set(true)\"\r\n          matTooltip=\"Notificações do Windows\" aria-label=\"Configurar notificações\">\r\n          <mat-icon>notifications</mat-icon>\r\n        </button>\r\n        <button class=\"btn-logout\" (click)=\"logout()\" matTooltip=\"Encerrar sessão\" aria-label=\"Sair\">\r\n          <mat-icon>logout</mat-icon>\r\n        </button>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Toggle tema fixo -->\r\n      <div class=\"sidebar-bottom\">\r\n        <span class=\"theme-label\">Tema</span>\r\n        <app-theme-toggle></app-theme-toggle>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </aside>\r\n\r\n  <!-- ══════════════ MAIN ══════════════ -->\r\n  <div class=\"main-area\" [hidden]=\"activeSection !== 'calendar'\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- ── GRUPO 1: Header ── -->\r\n    <div class=\"group-panel header-panel\">\r\n      <div class=\"header-main-row\">\r\n        <div class=\"header-left\">\r\n          <button class=\"btn-today\" (click)=\"goToday()\" id=\"btn-hoje\">Hoje</button>\r\n          <button class=\"nav-arrow\" (click)=\"navigate(-1)\" id=\"btn-prev\" aria-label=\"Período anterior\">\r\n            <mat-icon>chevron_left</mat-icon>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <button class=\"nav-arrow\" (click)=\"navigate(1)\" id=\"btn-next\" aria-label=\"Próximo período\">\r\n            <mat-icon>chevron_right</mat-icon>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <h1 class=\"period-label\">{{ periodLabel }}</h1>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"header-right\">\r\n          <!-- Indicador de Sync WebSocket -->\r\n          <div class=\"sync-indicator\" (click)=\"syncService.connect()\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\"\r\n            [matTooltip]=\"'Sincronização: ' + syncStatus() + (lastSyncLabel ? ' · ' + lastSyncLabel : '') + ' (Clique para reconectar)'\">\r\n            <span class=\"sync-dot\" [class]=\"syncStatus()\"></span>\r\n            <span class=\"sync-label\">{{ syncStatus() === 'connected' ? 'Online' : syncStatus() === 'connecting' ?\r\n              'Conectando' : 'Reconectar' }}</span>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n          <!-- View switcher -->\r\n          <div class=\"view-switcher\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Tipo de visualização\">\r\n            <button class=\"view-btn\" [class.active]=\"currentView === 'month'\" (click)=\"setView('month')\"\r\n              id=\"btn-view-month\">Mês</button>\r\n            <button class=\"view-btn\" [class.active]=\"currentView === 'week'\" (click)=\"setView('week')\"\r\n              id=\"btn-view-week\">Semana</button>\r\n            <button class=\"view-btn\" [class.active]=\"currentView === 'day'\" (click)=\"setView('day')\"\r\n              id=\"btn-view-day\">Dia</button>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Barra de Filtros Rápidos de Agendas (Pills) -->\r\n      <div class=\"agenda-pills-bar\" [class.is-collapsed]=\"!agendaPillsExpanded()\" *ngIf=\"calendars().length > 0\">\r\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"pills-toggle\" (click)=\"toggleAgendaPills()\"\r\n          [attr.aria-expanded]=\"agendaPillsExpanded()\" aria-controls=\"agenda-pills-list\"\r\n          [matTooltip]=\"agendaPillsExpanded() ? 'Ocultar seleção de agendas' : 'Mostrar seleção de agendas'\">\r\n          <mat-icon>{{ agendaPillsExpanded() ? 'chevron_left' : 'chevron_right' }}</mat-icon>\r\n          <span class=\"pills-label\">Agendas</span>\r\n        </button>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"pills-scroll\" id=\"agenda-pills-list\" *ngIf=\"agendaPillsExpanded()\">\r\n          <button *ngFor=\"let cal of calendars()\" class=\"agenda-pill\"\r\n            [class.active]=\"calendarsService.visibleCalendarIds().has(cal.id)\"\r\n            (click)=\"toggleCalendarVisibility(cal.id)\"\r\n            [matTooltip]=\"calendarDisplayName(cal) + ' · Clique para exibir esta agenda'\">\r\n            <span class=\"pill-dot\" [style.background]=\"cal.color\"></span>\r\n            <span class=\"pill-name\">{{ calendarDisplayName(cal) }}</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- ── GRUPO 2: Calendário ── -->\r\n    <div class=\"group-panel panel-fill calendar-panel\">\r\n\r\n      <app-month-view *ngIf=\"currentView === 'month'\" [year]=\"year\" [month]=\"month\" [events]=\"displayedEvents()\"\r\n        [holidays]=\"holidays\" (dayClick)=\"openCreateModal($event)\" (dayContextMenu)=\"openDayContextMenu($event)\"\r\n        (eventClick)=\"openViewModal($event)\" (eventContextMenu)=\"openEventContextMenu($event)\"\r\n        (eventDrop)=\"onEventDrop($event)\"></app-month-view>\r\n\r\n      <app-week-view *ngIf=\"currentView === 'week'\" [selectedDate]=\"selectedDate\" [events]=\"displayedEvents()\"\r\n        [holidays]=\"holidays\" (dayClick)=\"openCreateModal($event)\" (dayContextMenu)=\"openDayContextMenu($event)\"\r\n        (eventClick)=\"openViewModal($event)\" (eventContextMenu)=\"openEventContextMenu($event)\"\r\n        (eventDrop)=\"onEventDrop($event)\"></app-week-view>\r\n\r\n      <app-day-view *ngIf=\"currentView === 'day'\" [selectedDate]=\"selectedDate\" [events]=\"displayedEvents()\"\r\n        [holidays]=\"holidays\" (dayContextMenu)=\"openDayContextMenu($event)\" (eventClick)=\"openViewModal($event)\"\r\n        (eventContextMenu)=\"openEventContextMenu($event)\" (eventDrop)=\"onEventDrop($event)\"></app-day-view>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"main-area tasks-main\" [hidden]=\"activeSection !== 'tasks'\">\r\n    <app-kanban-board></app-kanban-board>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"main-area mural-main\" [hidden]=\"activeSection !== 'mural'\">\r\n    <app-mural-board></app-mural-board>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n@if (!aiService.isAssistantOpen()) {\r\n<app-livro-abrindo (opened)=\"openAiAssistant()\" />\r\n}\r\n\r\n@if (aiService.isAssistantOpen()) {\r\n<app-ai-assistant />\r\n}\r\n\r\n<div class=\"agenda-context-menu\" *ngIf=\"calendarContextMenu() as menu\" [style.left.px]=\"menu.x\" [style.top.px]=\"menu.y\"\r\n  (click)=\"$event.stopPropagation()\">\r\n  <button type=\"button\"\r\n    (click)=\"selectCalendarFromContext(menu.calendar)\"><mat-icon>filter_center_focus</mat-icon>Exibir esta\r\n    agenda</button>\r\n  <button type=\"button\" *ngIf=\"calendarsService.canEdit(menu.calendar.id)\"\r\n    (click)=\"editCalendarFromContext(menu.calendar)\"><mat-icon>edit</mat-icon>Editar agenda</button>\r\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"danger\" *ngIf=\"calendarsService.isOwner(menu.calendar.id) && !menu.calendar.isDefault\"\r\n    (click)=\"deleteCalendarFromContext(menu.calendar)\"><mat-icon>delete_outline</mat-icon>Excluir agenda</button>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"agenda-context-menu event-menu\" *ngIf=\"eventContextMenu() as menu\" [style.left.px]=\"menu.x\"\r\n  [style.top.px]=\"menu.y\" (click)=\"$event.stopPropagation()\">\r\n  <button type=\"button\" (click)=\"viewEventFromContext(menu.event)\"><mat-icon>visibility</mat-icon>Visualizar</button>\r\n  <ng-container *ngIf=\"canManageEvent(menu.event)\">\r\n    <button type=\"button\" (click)=\"editEventFromContext(menu.event)\"><mat-icon>edit</mat-icon>Editar</button>\r\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"danger\"\r\n      (click)=\"requestEventDeletion(menu.event)\"><mat-icon>delete_outline</mat-icon>Excluir</button>\r\n  </ng-container>\r\n  <div class=\"context-menu-notice\" *ngIf=\"!canManageEvent(menu.event)\"><mat-icon>lock</mat-icon><span>{{ menu.event.isTaskDeadline ? 'Edite este prazo pelo card em Tarefas' : menu.event.isSystem ? 'Evento gerenciado pelo sistema' : 'Acesso somente para visualização' }}</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"agenda-context-menu day-menu\" *ngIf=\"dayContextMenu() as menu\" [style.left.px]=\"menu.x\"\r\n  [style.top.px]=\"menu.y\" (click)=\"$event.stopPropagation()\">\r\n  <button type=\"button\" (click)=\"createEventFromContext(menu.date)\"><mat-icon>add_circle_outline</mat-icon>Criar\r\n    evento</button>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"invitation-overlay\" *ngIf=\"eventDeleteTarget() as event\" (mousedown)=\"cancelEventDeletion()\">\r\n  <section class=\"invitation-modal delete-calendar-modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\"\r\n    aria-labelledby=\"delete-event-title\" (mousedown)=\"$event.stopPropagation()\">\r\n    <div class=\"invitation-icon delete-icon\"><mat-icon>event_busy</mat-icon></div>\r\n    <h2 id=\"delete-event-title\">Excluir evento</h2>\r\n    <p>Deseja excluir <strong>{{ event.title }}</strong>?</p>\r\n    <p class=\"delete-warning\">O evento será removido permanentemente da agenda.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"invitation-actions\">\r\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"invitation-decline\" [disabled]=\"eventDeleteLoading()\"\r\n        (click)=\"cancelEventDeletion()\">Cancelar</button>\r\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"delete-calendar-confirm\" [disabled]=\"eventDeleteLoading()\"\r\n        (click)=\"confirmEventDeletion()\"><mat-icon>{{ eventDeleteLoading() ? 'hourglass_top' : 'delete_outline'\r\n          }}</mat-icon>{{ eventDeleteLoading() ? 'Excluindo...' : 'Excluir evento' }}</button>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-invitation-overlay\"\r\n  *ngIf=\"kanbanService.teamInvitations().length && kanbanService.teamInvitations()[0] as invitation\">\r\n  <section class=\"team-invitation-modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\">\r\n    <span class=\"invitation-team-icon\" [style.background]=\"invitation.team_color\"><mat-icon>group_add</mat-icon></span>\r\n    <h2>Convite para time</h2>\r\n    <p>Você foi convidado(a) para participar do time <strong>{{ invitation.team_name }}</strong> e colaborar no Kanban\r\n      compartilhado.</p>\r\n    <div><button class=\"cancel-btn\"\r\n        (click)=\"kanbanService.respondToTeamInvitation(invitation, false)\">Recusar</button><button class=\"primary-btn\"\r\n        (click)=\"kanbanService.respondToTeamInvitation(invitation, true)\">Aceitar convite</button></div>\r\n  </section>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ── Modal de Gerenciamento de Agenda ── -->\r\n<app-calendar-manager *ngIf=\"showCalendarManager\" [calendar]=\"editingCalendar\" (closed)=\"closeCalendarManager()\"\r\n  (saved)=\"onCalendarSaved()\"></app-calendar-manager>\r\n\r\n<app-notification-settings *ngIf=\"notificationSettingsOpen()\"\r\n  (closed)=\"notificationSettingsOpen.set(false)\"></app-notification-settings>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"invitation-overlay\" *ngIf=\"calendarDeleteTarget as calendar\" (mousedown)=\"cancelCalendarDelete()\">\r\n  <section class=\"invitation-modal delete-calendar-modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\"\r\n    aria-labelledby=\"delete-calendar-title\" (mousedown)=\"$event.stopPropagation()\">\r\n    <div class=\"invitation-icon delete-icon\"><mat-icon>delete_outline</mat-icon></div>\r\n    <h2 id=\"delete-calendar-title\">Excluir agenda</h2>\r\n    <p>Deseja excluir <strong>{{ calendar.name }}</strong>?</p>\r\n    <p class=\"delete-warning\">Todos os eventos vinculados serão removidos permanentemente.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"invitation-actions\">\r\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"invitation-decline\" [disabled]=\"calendarDeleteLoading\"\r\n        (click)=\"cancelCalendarDelete()\">Cancelar</button>\r\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"delete-calendar-confirm\" [disabled]=\"calendarDeleteLoading\"\r\n        (click)=\"confirmCalendarDelete()\"><mat-icon>{{ calendarDeleteLoading ? 'hourglass_top' : 'delete_outline'\r\n          }}</mat-icon>{{ calendarDeleteLoading ? 'Excluindo...' : 'Excluir agenda' }}</button>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"invitation-overlay\" *ngIf=\"invitationsService.invitations().length\">\r\n  <section class=\"invitation-modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\">\r\n    <div class=\"invitation-icon\"><mat-icon>group_add</mat-icon></div>\r\n    <h2>Convite para agenda</h2>\r\n    <ng-container *ngIf=\"invitationsService.invitations()[0] as invitation\">\r\n      <p>Você foi convidado(a) para participar da agenda <strong>{{ invitation.calendar_name }}</strong>.</p>\r\n      <p class=\"invitation-permission\">Permissão: {{ invitation.permission === 'editor' ? 'leitura e gr